{"ID":"20240521154356-acww7qn","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"1f3b8","id":"20240521154356-acww7qn","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240521154356-acww7qn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240521154431-i8onk0j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240521154617-mh4tmzs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240521154431-i8onk0j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"10.長壽報導專區","type":"doc","updated":"20240523092349"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240521154431-i8onk0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154431-i8onk0j","updated":"20240521154436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"英人瑞同一農舍住了一百年"}]},{"ID":"20240521154431-bksozkr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154431-bksozkr","updated":"20240521154431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2007/11/06 19:00"}]},{"ID":"20240521154431-svid9oy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154431-svid9oy","updated":"20240521154431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英國一位百歲人瑞桃樂絲在同一棟農舍裡住了一輩子。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154431-38hqc8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154431-38hqc8g","updated":"20240521154431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桃樂絲的父親是個牧羊人，在他出生前六年，也就是民國前十年，父親到桑莫斯養羊，搬進了這棟農舍。當時的農舍有三個房間，但是沒有浴室、沒電也沒自來水。四十年前，才添了一間浴室。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(只要是被遺忘的人，都是長壽的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154431-yk0ba8y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154431-yk0ba8y","updated":"20240521154431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桃樂絲有三個哥哥姊姊，自己一直沒結婚。父母死了以後，由哥哥照顧他。哥哥前兩年過世，姪子、姪女也先後離開人世。現在就剩下一個人住在農舍裡。他說，他一直住在農舍裡，不會搬走。昨天還在農舍度過百歲誕辰。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(此人因為沒有注射感冒疫苗與吃西藥跟維他命等，而註定長壽。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154431-9vl0hx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154431-9vl0hx2","updated":"20240521154431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桃樂絲回憶說，以前沒有自來水，還得到井裡打水，再放到爐子上燒。一到冬天凍得要命，全家只靠一個壁爐取暖。所以，他對現在有水、有電、有暖氣的生活十分滿意。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(乾淨的水源是長壽之源，而知足常樂也是長壽的原因之一。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154431-1c975vc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154431-1c975vc","updated":"20240521154431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"沒有被汙染的環境就是長壽要件"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154431-8j68a96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154431-8j68a96","updated":"20240521154431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   這個人瑞證明了，只要生活越簡單就越長壽，不吃西藥與維他命，加上不注射各種疫苗，也是長壽原因，現在住在都市中的人們，請自己摸著良心說，你們可以想像嗎？這位人瑞是被當地的衛生署遺忘的人，所以可以倖存至今，大家該醒過來了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154431-f99w593","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154431-f99w593","updated":"20240521154431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫  倪海廈07/22/2008"}]},{"ID":"20240521154431-3y1ervu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154431-3y1ervu"}},{"ID":"20240521154444-cjrjtsf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154444-cjrjtsf","updated":"20240521154447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"烏克蘭人瑞長壽秘訣 沒碰過女人 沒讀過書"}]},{"ID":"20240521154444-n74d042","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154444-n74d042","updated":"20240521154444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2007/04/29 15:00"}]},{"ID":"20240521154444-gsmxozz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154444-gsmxozz","updated":"20240521154444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"烏克蘭一個一百一十六歲的人瑞﹝奈斯特﹞說，他能活這麼久主要是因為他一輩子沒碰過女人，沒念過書。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這裡有錯誤，碰不碰女人與長壽無關，不然全世界的出家人都應該長壽才對，沒唸過書才是他真正長壽的原因。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154444-98fap41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154444-98fap41","updated":"20240521154444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"﹝奈斯特﹞是個住在基輔附近的牧羊人。他說，他是虔誠的基督徒。依照教義，婚前不可以有性行為。而他一輩子沒娶過太太自然沒有過性行為。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(大家千萬不可以學他，人人都像他一樣，將來就沒有後代了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154444-1n7a7nk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154444-1n7a7nk","updated":"20240521154444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"﹝奈斯特﹞解釋，他沒什麼好奇心。對異性並不好奇。也由於不好奇，就不會想知道男女關係，由於不知道就更沒興趣。他也就守身如玉了一輩子。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(男人對女人沒興趣了，人生也太乏味，大家都不要生小孩算了，教宗也沒有近女色，活的也沒有他長，所以這不是他長壽的原因。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154444-9tcfrkp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154444-9tcfrkp","updated":"20240521154444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"除了沒結過婚，他也沒念過書。他一共只上過兩天學，學會了寫名字以後就不去了。他的結論是，知道的越少，越快樂、越長壽。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這裡最後的結論才是他真正長壽的原因。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154444-1y8qfpf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154444-1y8qfpf","updated":"20240521154444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"不知就是長壽的主因，不知與真知才是知"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154444-o3olmn3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154444-o3olmn3","updated":"20240521154444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   我一直在勸告讀者不要每年去做體檢，妳知道的越多就死的越快，根本就是死於西醫之手，不要知道自己身體如何，遠比去給西醫做體檢要好許多，西方醫學是想盡辦法讓你害怕，讓你擔憂，所以他們對於病的陳述都是要讓你害怕，如果你沒有病，他們還會替你製造出一個疾病來，讓你徬徨無助，於是你就任由他們宰割，由於這種人很多，所以西方醫學才能大行其道，上面這個案例就是一個最標準的證明，這位人瑞一生都不知道他的身體如何也不想知道，所以他就越快樂，也越長壽，直到今日所有的證據都顯示出，凡是相信西醫的都短命，遠離西醫的都長命。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154444-0a5yv9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154444-0a5yv9x","updated":"20240521154444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    這位人瑞如果將他送到西醫院去做檢查，此人必有癌症，但是他現在仍然健康的原因就是因為有癌症，我們人類有癌症是很正常的事情，有一個癌症在身體裡，就不會有其他的癌症發生，這就是潘朵拉的盒子，不要去碰它讓它平靜的待在體內，你反而因此而受惠，中醫學認為人的生命極限是一百二十五歲，但是要像上面這位牧羊人一樣住在沒有污染的地方，同時沒娶到很囉唆的老婆才行做到。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154444-pnbl7t6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154444-pnbl7t6","updated":"20240521154444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   我有一位C肝病人，身體一直都很好，有一天很慌張的跑來跟我說他被告知得到肝癌了，我告訴他不要聽西醫的話，不要再去做檢查，他不聽，於是去開刀，不出三週就走了，得年48歲而已，他"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果不知道他得到肝癌的話，我肯定到今天他都還是活著的。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154444-0x4pscw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154444-0x4pscw","updated":"20240521154444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫  倪海廈07/22/2008"}]},{"ID":"20240521154444-jxcg7gd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154444-jxcg7gd"}},{"ID":"20240521154453-bu8ky2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154453-bu8ky2y","updated":"20240521154455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"沖繩人為什麼長壽？　美國營養師取經"}]},{"ID":"20240521154453-packe0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154453-packe0w","updated":"20240521154453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2007/10/31 17:52 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"記者:國際中心／綜合報導"}]},{"ID":"20240521154453-l5g9sx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154453-l5g9sx3","updated":"20240521154453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日本人善於養生，向來有長壽之國的稱號，但在日本各地，又以哪裡的人最長壽呢？答案就在最南端的琉球全島，也就是俗稱的沖繩；沖繩人長壽的秘訣，連"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://www.hantang.com/chinese/ch_Articles/longlife33.htm?","TextMarkATitle":"美國","TextMarkTextContent":"美國"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的營養師都遠渡重洋跨海來取經。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(世界上最差的就是這營養師了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154453-huppikn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154453-huppikn","updated":"20240521154453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"走在沖繩的鄉村小路上，路邊到處可以看到老先生、老太太手舞足蹈，開心地跳著當地傳統的舞蹈，其實他們今年已經都1百多歲了，像這樣的百歲人瑞一點都不稀奇，因為在整個沖繩，就有8百多名百歲以上的人瑞；而且雖然年紀已經一大把，仍然能夠下海捕魚或下田工作，老化對於他們來說，似乎不是個問題。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154453-9phjmgw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154453-9phjmgw","updated":"20240521154453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"對於沖繩人的長壽又健康，美國的營養師還特地跑來做調查，最後研究發現，他們的秘訣，在於從事許多勞動，因此延後了不少老年後的毛病，另外在飲食方面似乎也與眾不同，沖繩人習慣吃大量的深色水果與蔬菜，還有純天然未加工過的糙米及全麥食品。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這裡就開始犯錯了，他們居然不說出這些沖繩長壽人每天最重要的食物是海帶跟海藻，這才是真正重點所在。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154453-bh6qjh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154453-bh6qjh2","updated":"20240521154453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根據專家調查，沖繩的居民每天卡洛里的攝取比例，有7成全都來自蔬菜水果，適度攝取蛋白質，特別是魚和豆腐；此外，他們也吃豬肉，但是在吃之前會先將過多的油脂去掉，不過最重要的是，他們堅守一項「八分飽哲學」，顧名思義就是只吃八分飽，肚子飽了就馬上離開餐桌，不再吃任何食物。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這就是中醫學中所謂實不如虛。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154453-miz6j5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154453-miz6j5r","updated":"20240521154453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"全世界最蠢的就屬營養師了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154453-uxj7axd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154453-uxj7axd","updated":"20240521154453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    海帶與海藻是真正最讓人健康的食物，八分飽與多運動，證明了長壽的原因所在，全篇研究並沒有強調這些長壽人瑞是從不吃各種維他命與抗生素的，吃西藥與維他命會讓人越吃越短命，這裡就已經得到證明了，而這些重點，這群營養師卻絕口不提，主要原因就是與他們所要賣的維他命的目的，正好相反，一旦說出實話，世界上將不再需要營養師與營養劑了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154453-74adp2q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154453-74adp2q","updated":"20240521154453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    沖繩島居民之所以會長壽，就是因為他們那裡沒有這群笨營養師存在，人們安於現狀，安居樂業，辛勤工作，吃的簡單，沒有西藥的污染，這樣當然會長壽啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154453-0ukbius","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154453-0ukbius","updated":"20240521154453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫  倪海廈07/22/2008"}]},{"ID":"20240521154456-783t0cq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154456-783t0cq"}},{"ID":"20240521154504-2c89lx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154504-2c89lx8","updated":"20240521154506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"世界最老人瑞 從未胖過"}]},{"ID":"20240521154504-mpcrqb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154504-mpcrqb3","updated":"20240521154504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2008/04/20 16:00 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"編譯彭淮棟/綜合報導"}]},{"ID":"20240521154504-ksonwhn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154504-ksonwhn","updated":"20240521154504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"美國印第安納州老太太艾德娜‧帕克20日做115歲大壽。她是全球在世最高齡人瑞，也是科學家研究長壽奧秘的寶匙。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這些自命是科學家的笨蛋們，還想研究她長壽的基因，這根本不是基因的問題，由我來說她會長壽的原因吧。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154504-0a5bi7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154504-0a5bi7y","updated":"20240521154504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帕克1893年4月20日在家族農場出生，上大學拿到教學證書，在一所只有兩間教室的小學教書數年，到1913年結婚為止。丈夫1938年去世，當時她48歲，自此獨居，到一百歲才搬去和三個兒子裡唯一還在人世的克里福同住。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(她住在鄉下，先生過世後又沒有改嫁。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154504-6rvfl1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154504-6rvfl1k","updated":"20240521154504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  上百歲的艾德娜身體仍然硬朗，克里福夫婦很放心，有時只留她一人在家。有天晚上，夫婦倆出門看中學籃球賽，回家不見老母，全家焦急搜尋，在後院穀倉附近找到她。原來她走出戶外，被突來的暴風雪困住了，幾乎被大雪覆蓋，所幸身穿紅色毛線衣，在暗夜雪光裡才認得出來。克里福一把抱起凍僵的老母，急奔壁爐，醫護人員趕到，其中一人見艾德娜失溫危急，自己脫得只剩內衣，要克里福把艾德娜也脫得只剩內衣，然後貼身熨艾德娜。她除了指尖凍瘡，完全復元。但大家也決定老太太應該住進安養院。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(她家還有穀倉，表示她住鄉下，還有她喜歡紅色。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154504-896c6mq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154504-896c6mq","updated":"20240521154504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  安養院18日已經先為艾德娜慶生，她氣色爽朗，喜看親友放115隻氣球升空。老太太至今喜歡讀詩念詩，能隨口援引。她每天看報紙，欣賞各地寄來的問候卡，而且連照片裡的遠房親戚也認得出來。她另一樂趣是看氣球升空。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(她記性還很好啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154504-2xv8x2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154504-2xv8x2a","updated":"20240521154504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  去年4月，她和113歲的印第安納州第二人瑞、全球第五人瑞珀莎‧富萊見面，寫下「高齡會」紀錄。她收到布希總統的簽名信，也挺快樂，雖然她沒投他的票。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(她很開心啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154504-fqd7x0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154504-fqd7x0p","updated":"20240521154504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  20日是家族做壽，問老太太想穿什麼，她說不一定，但「紅色最好」。她有五個孫輩，13個曾孫，13個玄孫。她兩個姊妹分別在99、88歲時去世。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(紅色是熱情與開心的顏色。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154504-4t642hv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154504-4t642hv","updated":"20240521154504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  艾德娜何以長壽健康？可能是大半輩子在農場幫忙勞動，可能是家族基因，可能是基因和環境、健康習慣完美配合。性情可能也有貢獻，唐恩說他媽媽一輩子沒胖過，而且樂天極少發愁。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(跟基因無關的，又是某個笨蛋科學家自認為是的，體瘦跟開心才是長壽的主因。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154504-07raf9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154504-07raf9v","updated":"20240521154504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  全球目前只有75位110歲以上的「超級百歲人瑞」，其中女性64位，男性11位。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154504-hpbs20w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154504-hpbs20w","updated":"20240521154504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  波士頓大學「百歲人瑞研究中心」兩年前抽取艾德娜的血樣，存入超級人瑞DNA資料庫，希望早日找到這個領域的聖杯：長壽秘訣。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(答案就在眼前，大費周張的取得她的DNA，只是做秀，想多拿些研究經費罷了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154504-atne5hc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154504-atne5hc","updated":"20240521154504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154504-fh6es4b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154504-fh6es4b","updated":"20240521154504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   我國有句俗話說，從未見過長壽的胖子，長壽"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秘訣就是身體瘦。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就是常保持心開心無憂無求，這也是主因。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第三"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就是住在鄉下，每天的勞力工作很多，也沒有空氣污染與水源污染，吃的食物越原始越好，大家要儘量遠離基因改良食品。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第四"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此人瑞出生時西藥並沒有像現在如此之多，疫苗也沒有，也沒有害人生癌症又短命的維他命等，這更是她會長壽的主要原因， 因為她的身體沒有被西藥廠破壞，所以才健康長壽。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第五"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她每天都好開心愉快，沒有每年的體檢，西醫最善於使用嚇死人的醫學名辭，她一生沒有被嚇倒，所以她很開心，不像現在的人，自以為很聰明，每年去做體檢，最後根本就是被活活的嚇死的，因為不開心啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154504-hhdnm8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154504-hhdnm8l","updated":"20240521154504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"   人體是來自上天很完美的設計，會生病與短命是因為出現了一個惡魔，就是西藥廠了，大家該醒過來了。大家要學她，不要相信是長壽基因造成的長壽，以免又陷入西藥廠的陷阱之中。人類會短命就是西藥廠幹的惡事，它們使用與政客勾結，然後欺騙無知大眾的手段，來達成其賺錢的目的，這種西藥廠必須消滅，否則未來長壽的人瑞將絕跡了。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154504-4mt9nue","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154504-4mt9nue"}},{"ID":"20240521154513-72yno0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154513-72yno0f","updated":"20240521154515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"巴西叢林發現與世隔絕原始部落"}]},{"ID":"20240521154513-wejf0ym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154513-wejf0ym","updated":"20240521154513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2008/06/01 17:09"}]},{"ID":"20240521154513-9dseu8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154513-9dseu8v","updated":"20240521154513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴西人類學家最近在亞馬遜叢林發現一群從未跟現代文明接觸的原始部落。雖然當地大部份原住民因為濫墾濫伐面臨生存危機，但這支部落卻不受影響，人口反而有增加的趨勢。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(沒有西藥廠汙染的世界，人口是上升的，這已經證明西藥廠只會害人短命的惡魔。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154513-6vvfp5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154513-6vvfp5g","updated":"20240521154513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴西人類學家在西部亞克里省跟秘魯交界處的雨林區上空，拍攝到兩名全身抹上鮮紅顏料的原住民，朝著飛機拉弓射箭的畫面。茅屋外面還有另外15名原住民對著天上來意不明的龐然大物加強警戒。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154513-1h0zj4a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154513-1h0zj4a","updated":"20240521154513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根據人類學家的觀察，這個部落的人口有逐漸增加的趨勢，顯然雨林區濫墾濫伐的現象並沒有威脅到他們的生存。據估計，目前全世界與世隔絕的原始部落有上百個，大多分佈在巴西或是秘魯。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154513-lzp5hki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154513-lzp5hki","updated":"20240521154513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"從未與外界接觸的原住民，一旦被迫離開自己的土地，對於文明世界的各種疾病毫無抵抗力很容易因此喪命。原始部落保護團體，生存國際，也因此大聲疾呼，希望這些原始部落居民的領土能受到國際法的保護，不要讓他們從此消失在地球上。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這裡說的文明疾病就是西藥廠所製造出來的疾病，原本人類根本就不該有這種病的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154513-mmqky4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154513-mmqky4k","updated":"20240521154513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154513-gsdno0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154513-gsdno0w","updated":"20240521154513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  文明世界的文明病就是多虧有西藥廠後才發生的，原本是不存在的，像愛滋病就是文明病，是西藥廠研發小兒痲痺疫苗所製造出來的疾病，小孩得到血癌與腦瘤也是拜西藥廠研發的小兒痲痺疫苗所賜的，沒有這種疫苗，根本也就沒有這種問題出現，這篇報導也證明西藥廠必須摧毀才行，否則人類將永無安寧的日子可過。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154516-il8o353","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154516-il8o353"}},{"ID":"20240521154521-vxl9npl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154521-vxl9npl","updated":"20240521154525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"英101歲老翁完成馬拉松壯舉　紐奇人日跑世界最陡街30次"}]},{"ID":"20240521154521-29kancy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154521-29kancy","updated":"20240521154521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2008/04/27 15:31 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"記者陳國華編譯"}]},{"ID":"20240521154521-intrng2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154521-intrng2","updated":"20240521154521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英國有一位101歲的人瑞，日前參加波士頓馬拉松大賽，以10個小時的時間順利跑完全程，成為全世界年紀最大的馬拉松選手。而在紐西蘭有一位56歲的男子，每天跑陡峭的街道來回30次，讓人嘖嘖稱奇。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(多運動是秘訣啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154521-0eknpab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154521-0eknpab","updated":"20240521154521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"高齡101歲的馬丁，現在每天都維持長跑的訓練，他日前參加著名的波士頓馬拉松大賽，以10個小時完成比賽，成為全世界年紀最大的馬拉松跑者，更令人好奇的是，馬丁既抽菸又喝酒，訓練後還不忘來杯啤酒。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(讀者看到這裡，此人又抽煙又喝酒，只要多運動，還是長壽啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154521-sundifw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154521-sundifw","updated":"20240521154521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"當被記者問到，訓練後喝酒似乎不是傳統的訓練方法時，馬丁則說，「我一直就不是個傳統的人，從來不是、未來也不是。」"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(傳統如果是對的，為何此人長壽呢? 他絕對不信西藥廠與維他命。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154521-u8ch31q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154521-u8ch31q","updated":"20240521154521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在紐西蘭也有一位熱愛運動的爺爺級人物，他就是56歲的年輕爺爺克納漢，每天在但尼丁市的波德恩街跑步，這條街道是被金氏世界紀錄認定為全球最陡的街道，他每天來回跑上30趟，還表示跑這種陡峭的坡路需要一點訣竅。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154521-26nx6te","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154521-26nx6te","updated":"20240521154521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"克納漢說，「如果你向前傾你就完了，所以你必須向後仰，而且要儘量兩腳打直。」"}]},{"ID":"20240521154521-yoa2u6p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154521-yoa2u6p","updated":"20240521154521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"克納漢於11年前開始這項艱難的跑步運動，他說當初僅是為了健身，沒想到愈跑愈有興趣，現在每天都要跑，克納漢在全球最陡的街道跑步也已成為當地的觀光景點之一，他表示只要健康狀況正常，就會一直跑下去。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154521-a39n8ro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154521-a39n8ro","updated":"20240521154521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154521-qvzuu8y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154521-qvzuu8y","updated":"20240521154521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   長壽的秘訣就是多運動，這裡就證明了我國的功夫是重要的長壽工具，無論是太極拳，個各種武術健身術都是好的，多運動絕對比每天吃維他命都有效，維他命越吃越短命，越多運動就越長命。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154521-rtfd5lc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154521-rtfd5lc"}},{"ID":"20240521154533-q7b1wij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154533-q7b1wij","updated":"20240521154533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"長壽無癌侏儒村 醫界珍寶"}]},{"ID":"20240521154533-ensa2vt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154533-ensa2vt","updated":"20240521154533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2008/08/18 04:33 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"閻紀宇／綜合報導"}]},{"ID":"20240521154533-hqos6ot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154533-hqos6ot","updated":"20240521154533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t在南美洲厄瓜多共和國南部洛哈省一座遙遠的村落，有一百多位村民天賦異稟，他們不僅特別長壽，而且不會得糖尿病，甚至不會得癌症，被許多科學家視為研究新一代癌症療法的希望所寄。不過他們有一個「缺點」：平均身高只有一百廿分左右，是一群罹患「萊倫氏症候群」（Laron syndrome）的侏儒。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(讀者看這一段就知道西醫學有多差，連一個已經被確定沒有癌症與不會得到糖尿病的超級長壽種族，都會被西醫冠上一個病名，西藥廠就是要大家都有病，它們才有生存空間，才有機會賣藥。 如果大家都是矮的，那高的就是缺點了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154533-srlh8xc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154533-srlh8xc","updated":"20240521154533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   萊倫氏症候群又名「生長激素遲鈍症候群」，是一種罕見的體染色體隱性遺傳疾病，全球約只有三百多位患者，台灣也曾出現病例。主要症狀包括生長嚴重遲緩、骨質疏鬆、肌肉發育不良等。在臨床上分為兩型，第一型肇因於生長激素受體基因缺失，第二型則是「類胰島素生長因子-1」（IGF-1）出現缺失。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(被西醫定義為有病的人，卻是不會得到癌症與糖尿病的人，這種醫學的想法是否很奇怪。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154533-gmp5onx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154533-gmp5onx","updated":"20240521154533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   厄瓜多內分泌學家蓋瓦拉－阿奎爾研究萊倫氏症候群長達十多年，有了驚人發現：這些患者不會得癌症，關鍵在於他們體內的IGF-1濃度特別低。科學家已經證實，IGF-1濃度偏高會增加罹患乳癌、攝護腺癌、腸胃癌等多種癌症的風險。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這種說法讓西醫必須做出選擇，要長壽就必須矮，要高就要面臨癌症與糖尿病的威脅，西醫真是沒有Common Sense，就是笨啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154533-q9b98uo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154533-q9b98uo","updated":"20240521154533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   蓋瓦拉－阿奎爾表示，醫界可以借鏡萊倫氏症候群患者的基因變異，找出降低IGF-1濃度的方法，進而達到預防癌症的功效。而且可能連第二型糖尿病也能夠預防，因為萊倫氏症候群患者向來不知糖尿病為何物。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(西醫真是壞透了，用這種方式來欺騙人，事實上是不需要這樣做)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154533-1jelf8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154533-1jelf8j","updated":"20240521154533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   美國南加州大學的隆格博士已經進行實驗，以基因轉殖小鼠模擬萊倫氏症候群患者的基因變異，結果發現這些小鼠的壽命是正常小鼠的十倍。隆格博士認為，降低IGF-1濃度可以減少隨著老化而來的DNA缺損，這種缺損是導致癌症的元兇之一。未來醫藥界可望以降低IGF-1濃度為目標，研發能夠預防或治療癌症的藥物。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這種想法就是錯的醫學觀念，因為這些人長壽的原因不是這個，其中必有陰謀在內。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154533-if7gj2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154533-if7gj2a","updated":"20240521154533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"被西藥廠拿來做文章的案例"}]},{"ID":"20240521154533-zgnloar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154533-zgnloar","updated":"20240521154533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    這個少數民族真正會長壽的原因，是因為他們生活在醫個沒有被西藥與疫苗所污染的環境中，這樣少數的一百多人又住在偏遠地區，西藥廠是不會去關心的，所以他們都能倖免於被西藥廠洗腦與被西藥摧殘，住在沒有被汙染的外在環境中，加上體內也沒有被西藥汙染，當然就不會得到癌症，而貧困的生活，使得當地的每一個人都必須每天做許多勞力的工作，這種勞動就是運動之一，因此每天大量的將糖份燃燒掉，所以當然沒有第二型糖尿病出現，也沒有施打疫苗，所以也沒有第一型糖尿病出現，這就是當地人沒有癌症與糖尿病的真正原因所在。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154533-xvn28fd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154533-xvn28fd","updated":"20240521154533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    一般西醫對這類人，都按時施打生長激素，讓病人長高，現在出現這種案例，正好證明西醫過去是自己在打自己的耳光，你到底是要病人矮好些?還是病人生病好些? 如果大家都是矮子就會長壽又沒有癌症，那讓大家都變矮，自然不覺得奇怪或是難看，這真是笑話一則，這點可以說明使用人工激素是只會得到反效果的，看來現在西藥廠生產的生長激素都該停止再生產了，因為會讓人得到癌症跟糖尿病。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154533-89opms4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154533-89opms4","updated":"20240521154533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 西醫真是不要臉的醫學，明明這種長壽健康的人種是因為沒有西藥廠的汙染才會產生的，他們自圓其說，將之說成是醫界珍寶，事實上這個案例卻正好說明人類會得到癌症與糖尿病的原因就是來自西藥廠，而不是因為長太高得到的病。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154533-mu3qrn4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154533-mu3qrn4","updated":"20240521154533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫  倪海廈謹記於佛州08/18/2008"}]},{"ID":"20240521154533-cabva2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154533-cabva2g","updated":"20240521154533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"正好有一位學生在那裡住"}]},{"ID":"20240521154533-5uub5ae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154533-5uub5ae","updated":"20240521154533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   今天倪老師發表了一篇長壽報導，我覺得很有趣，因為我現在就是在厄瓜多爾的 Loja (洛哈)省的一個長壽村，叫做 Vilcabamba。這個地方被稱為是長壽村，並不是沒有原因的。因為落後，這邊的水質及空氣，尚未受人類污染。我和我的先生在這邊買了一塊小地，趁八月份亞利桑那州正如烤爐般的炎熱之下，在此地享受到陶淵明所說的世外桃源，與世無爭。我們在我們的一塊小地種很多有機的蔬菜、水果 (如照片)。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154533-1r6adet","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154533-1r6adet","updated":"20240521154533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   今天文章所說的侏儒，我倒是還沒有看到。不過，這邊有些高齡老人，雖然已經八十幾歲了，看起來才六十幾歲，而且說話非常有力，非常的健朗。問他們如何保持年輕，他們說，他們一天走路走了兩三個小時。由於沒有車子，大部分都是靠走路。他們還說，另一個秘訣是不吃西方進來的垃圾食物。最後重要的是，要保持心情愉快!  我所遇見的高齡老人，還沒有看到在吃西藥的。可能因為大家都很窮，沒法負擔的起西藥 (這反而是一件好事!)。很可惜的，現在西方的食物漸漸的進來厄瓜多爾，很多年輕人因為吃垃圾食物，已經未老先衰了，呈現虛肥狀。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154533-4k6scd3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154533-4k6scd3","updated":"20240521154533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  在此要感謝老師出版天紀。此時的我，在五千英尺高的厄瓜多爾安地斯山脈中，還能讀到老師的天紀，真是人生的一大享受。感謝老師傾囊相授，將這些中國的精華與我們分享。期望有一天能將天紀、人紀以及地紀融合，靈活運用。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154533-hh2pj8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154533-hh2pj8w","updated":"20240521154533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來函學生 劉X芳敬上08/22/2008"}]},{"ID":"20240521154538-5nfiv9o","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154538-5nfiv9o"}},{"ID":"20240521154545-lttvz6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154545-lttvz6j","updated":"20240521154548"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全球最高齡人瑞 薩爾瓦多128歲老婦去世"}]},{"ID":"20240521154545-wi1skl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154545-wi1skl2","updated":"20240521154545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2007/03/10 11:00"}]},{"ID":"20240521154545-wicgxse","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154545-wicgxse","updated":"20240521154545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"被認為是全世界最高齡人瑞的薩爾瓦多128歲婦人（克魯茲赫南德絲）去世。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154545-smscb7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154545-smscb7a","updated":"20240521154545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"克魯茲赫南德絲戶籍資料登記她是1878年五月三號出生，昨天，她在睡夢中去世，她的鄰居說，赫南德絲過去幾天，身體很不舒服，昨天，她吃過飯，喝了一些牛奶之後入睡，再也沒有醒來。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(牛奶是不能喝的，越喝越短命。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154545-ika0rkl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154545-ika0rkl","updated":"20240521154545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赫南德絲生過十三個孩子，有六十多個孫子，八十個曾孫，25個玄孫。親友和家人說，她"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"長壽的秘方是喝啤酒加生雞蛋"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。她擔任助產士一直到一百歲才退休，去年五月，她過128歲生日的時候，薩爾瓦多戶政單位曾經為她向金氏紀錄申請認證，不過沒有得到回覆。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154545-enli300","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154545-enli300","updated":"20240521154545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"金氏記錄上目前登載全世界最高齡的人瑞是114歲的日本婦人（皆川米子）。而金氏記錄記載全世界活得最久的一名男性，活到120歲，女性最長壽的紀錄是122歲。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154545-596hkx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154545-596hkx8","updated":"20240521154545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154545-micb99p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154545-micb99p","updated":"20240521154545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   所有長壽的人瑞都有一個共同點，就是從不吃各種維他命，這種害人短命的毒藥，居然還在銷售，因為有衛生署保護它們，上面這位人瑞每天喝生啤酒配合生雞蛋，西醫說不要吃雞蛋黃，因為怕膽固醇太高，會得心臟病，我卻每天告訴我的病人要多吃雞蛋黃，因為它可以抗癌，中醫甚至只用蛋黃入藥，來治療失眠，跟西醫正好相反。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154545-mc8k419","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154545-mc8k419"}},{"ID":"20240521154553-iphytps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154553-iphytps","updated":"20240521154555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"睡得少的人反而比較長壽"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n【大成報 記者 丁彥伶／報導】\n「大人」們都說，早睡早起身體好，還說一天要睡足八小時精神才足夠，讓很多晚睡的人愈來愈擔心自己的健康，睡得少的人也擔心自己那一天一定會「慢性疲勞症候群」突然發作，杏雨心靈診所院長陳俊欽表示，其實只要不影響日常生活和工作就不算失眠。\n其實這也是最近的研究才發現，人類並不像當初所想像，都是「日出而作，日落而息」的動物，和一般哺乳類動物一樣，人類也有夜行性的人類。\n至於要睡多久才夠？其實人類的睡眠時間也不盡相同，有短睡型也有長睡型，短睡型的人每天睡三小時就精神百倍，而長睡型的人就算睡得很熟，每天15小時也不夠睡，而且研究也發現，睡得少的人活力往往比睡得久的人好 事實上在前年美國加州大學聖地亞哥分校和美國癌症協會花了六年，分析了100多萬個美國人睡眠習慣的研究發現，睡眠時間長的人比中間質的人死亡率增加15%，而每天只睡5小時的人比起每天睡足8小時的人來說來得更長壽；誰說晚睡晚起、睡少的人就不健康呢？"}]},{"ID":"20240521154553-lbx4aj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154553-lbx4aj0","updated":"20240521154553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154553-cr7gqvk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154553-cr7gqvk","updated":"20240521154553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   中醫認為人能少眠智慮清明，世界上長壽之人本來就是睡很少的，我國的長壽村，你們去打聽一下，幾乎全員都睡很短，因為睡多是身體負擔，反而使體內累積毒素更深，因為睡眠會減緩體內新陳代謝的機能 ，多動才是最長壽的。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154553-9m48jo0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154553-9m48jo0","updated":"20240521154553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  此篇完全符合中醫理論的，請大家多多訓練自己，我多年以來,每天只睡約五小時左右，白天從不須要睡午覺，而體力充沛，當然與我練功有關，因此大家要練習些氣功最好，我會教授人紀班學生一些古老的十二經筋之類的中國功夫 ，讓大家身體都健康才行。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154556-68cptrs","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154556-68cptrs"}},{"ID":"20240521154603-qk00zhy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154603-qk00zhy","updated":"20240521154603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"想長壽:女得熱 男要冷"}]},{"ID":"20240521154603-uqxhos6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154603-uqxhos6","updated":"20240521154603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008-08-22"}]},{"ID":"20240521154603-01mo45h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154603-01mo45h","updated":"20240521154603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【中廣新聞／朱克威】"}]},{"ID":"20240521154603-s6ad5b7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154603-s6ad5b7","updated":"20240521154603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男女有別，就連長壽的秘訣也大不相同。科學家發現，想長壽，女人要熱，男人要冷。女性長壽之道是溫暖的陽光和沙灘；而男性長壽的秘訣則是涼爽宜人的氣候。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (這是中醫學中的陰陽關係。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154603-5b2icqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154603-5b2icqd","updated":"20240521154603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"新華網報導，澳洲政府公布了境內最長壽地區排行榜。女性最長壽地區是昆士蘭州的陽光海岸，平均壽命84.7歲，男性最長壽地區是墨爾本、坎培拉一帶，平均壽命80歲。從統計數字上來看，生活在溫暖、陽光充足地區的女性壽命比較長，而在氣候較涼爽地區長期生活的男性則比其它地方的男性更長壽。 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(女子為陰，故喜熱，男子為陽，故喜涼。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154603-1i2s320","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154603-1i2s320","updated":"20240521154603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這個規律不止澳洲，在全球範圍內同樣適用，例如冰島男人最長壽，平均為79.2歲，而日本男性則位居第三。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154603-7lno87r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154603-7lno87r","updated":"20240521154603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"調查人員分析，氣候對男女壽命的影響，可能與身體體質和激素有關，相比之下，女性更喜歡燦爛的陽光和溫暖的沙灘，男性則青睞於舒適涼爽的天氣，氣候會影響心理和生理多個方面，進而影響壽命。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154603-zev96dw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154603-zev96dw","updated":"20240521154603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研究人員同時指出，氣候條件只是影響壽命的一個因素，飲食、生活習慣、醫療水平、遺傳也很重要，想長壽要從多方面努力。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(只要不被西藥廠污染過的地方，無論男女都會出現長壽的人瑞。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154603-n0zhaqt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154603-n0zhaqt","updated":"20240521154603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"只對了一小部份"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154603-5wua7lw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154603-5wua7lw","updated":"20240521154603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    這篇報導是正確的，但是他們只研究了一半，還缺一半沒有研究到，女子為陰，除了外在的熱之外，還要內在的熱才會健康長壽，許多女子一年四季手腳都是冰冷的，這已經表示是裡寒，而西醫不知何謂裡寒，加上所有西藥與維他命都會造成人體內發生裡寒，於是在西藥盛行濫用的地方就會出現女子多是手腳冰冷的現象，因此當女子住在冷的地區，就變成外冷內又寒的現象，這種寒在中醫學裡就是得病之源了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154603-bma6t0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154603-bma6t0y","updated":"20240521154603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    男子為陽，本來就是偏於熱的體質，如果住在熱帶，裡熱加上外熱，就是過熱，這也是病之源，西醫學無寒熱之分，也無陰陽之分，因此西醫對於人體內的寒熱與陰陽的變化不了解，所以根本是一種無法預知也無法真正治病的醫學，而訓練良好的中醫師，就可以利用人體內的陰陽與寒熱的些微變化，可以在很早期就可以偵測到病 以經在初期的發展了，此時西醫師還不知道病人已經有問題，也不知如何在最早期用很簡單的方法就可以將病源去除，一般西醫都是要等到病情惡化時才發現，那時就已經失去治病的時機了，中醫學內經中所謂的 : "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"上工治未病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是這個意思。從這篇報導中可知，西醫學仍然差上中醫學一大截不只，我輩當以做一位中醫師為榮。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154603-5jpe6gk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154603-5jpe6gk","updated":"20240521154603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   想知道我的說法是否正確?很簡單，讀者去問一下你周圍的女子，多數女子手腳都是冰冷的，如果你將這個問題去問西醫師，就是雞同鴨講的問題，如果你問到溫病派的中醫師，他們也支吾其詞，不知如何回答，只有真正正統的經方家中醫，才知道如何回答這個問題的。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154604-5igrmzc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154604-5igrmzc"}},{"ID":"20240521154611-f6tbcnq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154611-f6tbcnq","updated":"20240521154611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"百歲人瑞老兵 啃山東饅頭養生"}]},{"ID":"20240521154611-yxscyfb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154611-yxscyfb","updated":"20240521154611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【胡欣男／桃園報導】中國時報 2008-09-10"}]},{"ID":"20240521154611-fsywwzo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154611-fsywwzo","updated":"20240521154611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"民國前三年九月九日出生的老榮民呂秀峰，昨日「晉升」百歲人瑞。他曾參加抗日游擊隊，在山東青島作戰時被手榴彈炸傷腰腹，後輾轉來台販售山東大饅頭維生。他表示，饅頭正是他獨門養生秘訣，每天至少吃兩大顆，現在除年輕時作戰的腰傷外，硬朗得很！"}]},{"ID":"20240521154611-n1ja307","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154611-n1ja307","updated":"20240521154611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    　呂秀峰是山東高密人，年少從軍，民國卅四年在青島作戰，遭日軍手榴彈擊傷，忍痛繼續軍旅；抗戰勝利後他參加青年軍二○八師，在舟山群島與共軍作戰，卅八年隨軍來台，後因腸胃病申請退役，定居台中。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154611-crlkow4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154611-crlkow4","updated":"20240521154611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    　在台中的日子，是呂秀峰口中除烽火連天生涯外，印象最深刻的記憶。他與朋友合作「山東饅頭」沿街叫賣，直到民國五十三年因行動不便才叫停，轉投靠居住在桃園大溪鎮的弟弟呂秀庭。弟弟四年前去世，他靠弟媳無條件奉養至今，和樂融融，地方蔚為佳話。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154611-s23mm5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154611-s23mm5g","updated":"20240521154611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    　北方人熱愛麵食，呂秀峰尤其愛大饅頭，每天早晨必啃完一個大饅頭，中、晚餐吃清粥小菜，也少不了饅頭相配，一天至少吃兩個大饅頭。呂秀峰鮮少出門運動，但耳聰目明，看報不必戴眼鏡，偶而才吃點蔬菜水果，營養幾乎全靠饅頭。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (他的飲食習慣符合中醫學中"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"虛勝於實"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"的正確觀念，長年啃硬硬的山東饅頭，就是運動，所以能長壽。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154611-irtl5ce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154611-irtl5ce","updated":"20240521154611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\t昨桃縣榮民服務處長張占奎與榮欣志工等為他慶生，大夥圍著蛋糕高唱生日快樂歌，呂秀峰才意會到，每年僅有生日才吃蛋糕。他說：「我還是愛饅頭，山東人就該吃饅頭！」張占奎等還贈送重達八錢的純金壽桃致賀。壢新醫院營養師陳美芳建議，老年人因容易噎食，最好將饅頭切片泡牛奶食用。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(我從未聽過有老人因為吃鰻頭而噎死，這個營養師正在害人短命中。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154611-kp3m531","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154611-kp3m531","updated":"20240521154611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"長壽的原因"}]},{"ID":"20240521154611-yeu5pgc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154611-yeu5pgc","updated":"20240521154611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    這位人瑞的生活習慣，就是他真正長壽的原因，他飲食非常簡單，沒有大的慾望，一日兩個饅頭就很滿足，這就是中醫學中虛勝於實的健康長壽秘訣所在，長年的用牙齒咬硬饅頭，等於是在訓練牙齒的堅固，吃西點麵包，因為其中含有太多的人工糖在內，容易破壞牙齒的結構，反而不好，上面那位營養師的提議最壞 又蠢，居然叫他用牛奶泡饅頭吃，這種就是沒有Common Sense的笨蛋意見，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"牛奶不是給人喝的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，是給小牛喝的，做一個人，為何要跟小牛搶食物吃呢? 泡過的饅頭，缺少硬度，這會讓牙齒沒有機會練功，真的這樣做一段時間，此人牙齒必然會損壞，牙為骨之餘，而腎主骨，如此一來，就會間接的傷到腎臟，壽命就會變短，這位營養師該重回學校去多讀點書，我一再強調，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"短命的人要聽長壽人的話"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，這位營養師才幾歲呢 ? 居然叫一位比她長壽多多的人瑞聽她的蠢意見，真是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"要命的愚蠢建議。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154611-ypzdrve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154611-ypzdrve","updated":"20240521154611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 建議全世界的營養師們，你們應該多多研究哪些營養會支援餵食哪些癌症? 如果你們成功的話，不但可以拿諾貝爾獎，而且對人類的健康長壽，才能做出真正的貢獻，因為只要知道如何阻斷癌細胞營養的來源，就可以將癌症治好，不是嗎?"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154612-m9tavih","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154612-m9tavih"}},{"ID":"20240521154617-hg1tp4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154617-hg1tp4n","updated":"20240521154627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一個98 一個96 人瑞昆仲 孤苦相依啃饅頭度日"}]},{"ID":"20240521154622-5gioq1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154622-5gioq1z","updated":"20240521154623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中國時報 2007.03.03\n張南詠/南投報導"}]},{"ID":"20240521154617-8jyldon","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154617-8jyldon","updated":"20240521154617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 「我能想到最浪漫的事，就是和你一起慢慢變老，直到我們老得哪兒也去不了，你還依然把我當成手心裏的寶。」情歌裡描述的「浪漫」，雖然沒發生在這對兄弟身上，但兩人扶持到「老」，把彼此當成「寶」，倒是真的。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154617-zh3we0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154617-zh3we0c","updated":"20240521154617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    九十八歲張以壁、九十六歲張景韓兄弟倆，是江蘇省阜寧縣人，早年隨國軍來台，四、五十歲退役並取得榮民身分後，以江蘇手藝捏出香Ｑ的饅頭、包子、春捲與豆漿，是老一輩中興新村人迄今難以忘懷的早點。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154617-xocwlb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154617-xocwlb4","updated":"20240521154617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    租陋屋數十年 他們樂其中"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (這就是他們長壽的主要原因。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154617-mh4tmzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154617-mh4tmzs","updated":"20240521154617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    年近百歲的兄弟檔，如今卻因「疑似罹患開放性肺結核」再度引起外界注意，處境令人噓唏，卻也讓人得窺兩老兄友弟恭相扶持的感人一幕。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154617-ij13g4s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154617-ij13g4s","updated":"20240521154617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    張氏昆仲因帶有濃濃的江蘇口音，雖影響與外界進一步的接觸機會，但因兄弟倆都很獨立自強，寧願自己花點錢請關懷協會居家服務員多來幾趟服務，也不願去麻煩別人。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154617-gyfqyv0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154617-gyfqyv0","updated":"20240521154617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    張氏兄弟承租一間簡陋平房，相依為命數十年，環境雖不起眼，甚至有種「貧民窟」的感覺，但他們仍自得其樂。上午十點，張以壁慢條斯理地到附近便利商店買瓶鮮奶，再從冰箱拿出兩個饅頭一起放著蒸煮；但年老健忘，鮮奶快煮乾、饅頭快燒焦，他才慢慢起身關爐火。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (就是因為吃到鮮奶，於是出現健忘現象，鮮奶是不可以吃的，只能給小牛喝。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154617-hhl2j9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154617-hhl2j9s","updated":"20240521154617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    「不要噎到喔！」張以壁細心提醒張景韓，張景韓似懶得聽嘮叨，懶得理他。張以壁沒有生氣，因為關懷是出自內心，何必在乎回應的「強度」，兄弟倆仍慢慢剝開饅頭，一小口一小口往嘴裡塞。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (貧困使他們沒錢買維他命，當然不生病又長壽，正好證明中醫認為虛勝於實的觀念是正確的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154617-hgbhtow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154617-hgbhtow","updated":"20240521154617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    誰大不打緊 要一起活下去"}]},{"ID":"20240521154617-nhbiviq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154617-nhbiviq","updated":"20240521154617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    張以壁透露，身分證上他是民國前一年生，張景韓為民國一年生，鄰居每次看到他推著張景韓輪椅散步，都以為是哥哥服務弟弟；事實上他才是弟弟，張景韓是哥哥，當年因鄉音之故造成筆誤，私底下他都稱張景韓「老大」。不過張景韓卻懶得理他，因為誰兄、誰弟已不重要，重要的是如何一起活下去！"}]},{"ID":"20240521154617-1weu7g7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154617-1weu7g7","updated":"20240521154617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    不論誰大誰小，高齡的兄弟倆，對外人而言都是「兩寶」，如此高壽已經罕見，何況是相互照應，步履蹣跚的人瑞推著行動不便的人瑞，這一幕任誰看了都感動。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (關愛是另一個讓人長壽的原因，)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154617-84d9nol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154617-84d9nol","updated":"20240521154617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    只不過兄弟最近可能暫時無法享受新鮮空氣了。因為推動輪椅的張以壁疑似罹患開放性肺結核，必須接受治療；而哥哥少了弟弟當手腳，哪裡也去不了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154617-efztsuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154617-efztsuq","updated":"20240521154617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    形影不離 手足情溢於言表"}]},{"ID":"20240521154617-9cbw93d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154617-9cbw93d","updated":"20240521154617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    昆仲情深，無論發生任何事，兄弟都形影不離，手足之情，溢於言表，他們，才是最幸福的兄弟檔。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154617-s2stfan","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154617-s2stfan","updated":"20240521154617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154617-rq27gxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154617-rq27gxc","updated":"20240521154617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   讀者看看這篇報導，它很清楚的告訴大家，親情也是長壽的必要條件，沒有親情生活無依靠，對身體不好。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154617-eloja8f","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154617-eloja8f"}},{"ID":"20240521154636-bdolzm0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154636-bdolzm0","updated":"20240521154637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"苗111歲人瑞 羅賴娣妹仙逝"}]},{"ID":"20240521154636-8kg7xgx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154636-8kg7xgx","updated":"20240521154636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【聯合報／記者范榮達／苗栗報導】"}]},{"ID":"20240521154636-kcf15cq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154636-kcf15cq","updated":"20240521154636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苗栗縣最高壽的人瑞羅賴娣妹日前因胸悶氣喘住院，前晚10時餘壽終正寢，享壽111歲，她5代子孫116人及地方人士咸認福壽雙全。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154636-0bpwmgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154636-0bpwmgp","updated":"20240521154636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羅賴娣妹於3月25日因胸悶氣喘到苗栗市大千醫院住院治療，家屬說，她在醫院的狀況相當良好，前天下午5時餘還一直說要回家，到了晚上9時餘，身體突然不舒服，1個多小時後壽終正寢，靈堂設在苗栗市福星里羅屋宗祠，8日舉行告別式。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(我最常跟病人說的ㄧ句話，就是當你知道這ㄧ天到來時，你就可以去醫院，否則不要去。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154636-d0ry0z8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154636-d0ry0z8","updated":"20240521154636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"羅賴娣妹的養生之道是從不挑食，民國90年2月、91年9月因膽結石及右手骨折，兩度住院開刀，復原都很快，她每次選舉都不缺席，由子孫攙扶投票。 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(世界上所有長壽人瑞，從沒有ㄧ人是吃西藥或是吃維他命而長壽的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154636-lgn5fmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154636-lgn5fmm","updated":"20240521154636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她是苗栗縣敬老的標竿，苗栗縣第一張新式身分證94年12月間發給她，她記憶也不錯，每年重陽敬老誰去慰訪？送她多少禮金？都記得一清二楚，還會當起「總管」吩咐家人準備水果、客家湯圓，好好招待客人，縣府參議、前社會局長陳星宇最喜歡吃她做的湯圓。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154636-vmyvz3g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154636-vmyvz3g","updated":"20240521154636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154636-2yogjfx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154636-2yogjfx","updated":"20240521154636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   生活簡單，不要每天勾心鬥角，永遠保持開朗的心情，遠離西藥維他命與疫苗等害人玩意，感冒生病時吃中藥，如此大家必然健康長壽， 迷信西醫藥的人都肥胖又短命，真是糟蹋自己。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154636-heso8cg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154636-heso8cg"}},{"ID":"20240521154644-7n3iv03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154644-7n3iv03","updated":"20240521154645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"九旬高齡老太太　每天喝酒不吃飯"}]},{"ID":"20240521154644-cc870ec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154644-cc870ec","updated":"20240521154644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2007/03/30 14:08 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"記者:陸惠玲"}]},{"ID":"20240521154644-rtt5gtm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154644-rtt5gtm","updated":"20240521154644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"喝酒能長壽嗎？大陸福建有位高齡92歲的老太太，她每天最大的嗜好就是喝酒，寧可不吃飯，卻把酒當飲料來喝，而且喝完酒，臉不紅、精神比平時更好，酒量一級棒。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154644-9w6ymye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154644-9w6ymye","updated":"20240521154644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"高齡92歲的謝老太太，悠閒的坐在院子裡和鄰居們聊天，旁邊還擺了一杯飲料，這是老太太最愛喝的酒。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154644-lqvpy2w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154644-lqvpy2w","updated":"20240521154644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"愛喝酒的消息還上了當地的報紙，成了村裡的奇人，老太太寧可不吃飯，但這酒絕對不能不喝。謝老太太女兒：「每天要喝1斤多，青紅酒要喝一瓶多。」記者：「平時除了喝酒還吃什麼？」謝老太太女兒：「湯圓、元宵吃一點。」"}]},{"ID":"20240521154644-kpczmu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154644-kpczmu4","updated":"20240521154644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"喝完酒，老太太臉不紅、也不會心跳加速，頭腦比平常更清楚，她說，自己從年輕時就很會喝，年齡越大、酒量也越大，說著說著，酒癮又上來了。謝老太太女兒：「媽，酒倒點給你喝？」謝老太太：「好，去倒。」"}]},{"ID":"20240521154644-8z3w7y0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154644-8z3w7y0","updated":"20240521154644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"老太太的兒女原本擔心，她年紀這麼大了，喝酒會傷身，但沒想到，她的身體似乎比以前更加健康。然而，喝酒是老太太的養生之道嗎？認識她的人都說，經常帶著開朗的心情，才是老太太真正的長壽秘方。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這就是長壽秘訣)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154644-xbl5d44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154644-xbl5d44","updated":"20240521154644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154644-3ico3kh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154644-3ico3kh","updated":"20240521154644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    人類本來就該有開朗的心情，西藥廠不同意這個，因此他們持續不斷的製造出病名來，也不斷的去製造疾病出來，其目的就是要人不開心，如果嚇不到人，就沒人聽他們的，他們就沒有錢賺，所以以後將不再有這類長壽人瑞了，上述案例已經證明連喝酒都比吃維他命還好還要長壽，不是嗎？"}]},{"ID":"20240521154644-v2xxgl3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154644-v2xxgl3"}},{"ID":"20240521154651-45i0w28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154651-45i0w28","updated":"20240521154654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"金氏世界紀錄：全球最年長人瑞是美黑奴後代"}]},{"ID":"20240521154651-jfqs1iz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154651-jfqs1iz","updated":"20240521154651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2007/01/27 10:05 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"記者:盧瑞珠"}]},{"ID":"20240521154651-8fg45ei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154651-8fg45ei","updated":"20240521154651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（法新社紐約二十六日電） 金氏世界紀錄集團表示，在波多黎各的麥卡多戴杜羅於日前辭世，享年一百一十五歲後，現存世界上最年長人瑞是一百一十四歲、住在美國康乃狄克州的黑奴之女愛瑪提爾曼。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154651-93xkmmh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154651-93xkmmh","updated":"20240521154651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"金氏世界紀錄集團在網站中指出，提爾曼一八九二年十一月二十二日出生在北卡羅來納吉普森維爾的一個黑人家庭，曾經在影星凱薩琳赫本的家中幫佣。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154651-bii4dip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154651-bii4dip","updated":"20240521154651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她出生時正是哈里遜擔任美國總統，那時候電話還沒有發明，盤尼西林也還沒有被研發出來。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這才是她真正長壽的原因所在，因為當時沒有許多西藥存在。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154651-qi03g2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154651-qi03g2z","updated":"20240521154651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一直到現在，提爾曼已歷經二十位美國總統，並在兩次世界大戰中存活下來，同時也躲過二零零一年的九一一攻擊事件。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(艱苦的生活是長壽的原因，小時也沒有注射過各種害人的疫苗。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154651-1uhrx5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154651-1uhrx5h","updated":"20240521154651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"提爾曼家族似乎都有長壽的遺傳因子，她的四位手足都活到一百歲以上，包括她的兄弟死時高壽一百零八歲，三個姊妹都分別活到一百零五歲、一百零二歲和一百零二歲。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這裡不正確，她們家人都長壽原因不是因為有長壽因子，而是因為她們都生活在同一年代，當時大家都沒有打疫苗，都沒有抗生素，都沒有止痛藥，都沒有維他命，所以長壽。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154651-zbaarf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154651-zbaarf5","updated":"20240521154651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154651-tp7wr0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154651-tp7wr0o","updated":"20240521154651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  現代的西醫師真正要很汗顏才對，因為這上面些人一生都沒有得到最好的照顧，也都不懂現代的西醫學，但是卻都因此而長壽，而自認為懂西醫學的西醫師們平均年齡只能活五十四歲，連她的一半都不到，原因就是濫用西藥造成的，這已經是直接證據，證明了西藥是害人更短命的，只有笨蛋才會去相信西醫藥的。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154652-5s3bxqi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154652-5s3bxqi"}},{"ID":"20240521154702-beou9az","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154702-beou9az","updated":"20240521154703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阿聯酋120歲人瑞 生平首次進醫院便告身亡"}]},{"ID":"20240521154702-u3oi0wl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154702-u3oi0wl","updated":"20240521154702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【路透／迪拜電】 2003年8月19日"}]},{"ID":"20240521154702-xlwbva8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154702-xlwbva8","updated":"20240521154702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"海灣新聞日報周二報導，阿聯酋一名120歲的男子生平第一次求醫即告不治。 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(如果他能保持一生不就醫的記錄,他必然會活的好好的.)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154702-zk1v84d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154702-zk1v84d","updated":"20240521154702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"該報說，這位名叫阿克什的老人周一來到醫院，接受一次簡單的胃部手術，但術後幾小時便告別人世。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (如果此人的胃病是找中醫來治療，就不會死的)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154702-7n2q2uq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154702-7n2q2uq","updated":"20240521154702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他的幾名兒子說，父親年輕時做過潛水員，此後盡管年事已高，但身體極為健康，思維非常敏捷。他們說，老人的長壽要歸功於其飲食--食譜包括椰棗、魚、蜂蜜和咖啡。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154702-wenwp5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154702-wenwp5r","updated":"20240521154702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154702-5ecyi26","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154702-5ecyi26","updated":"20240521154702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   長壽的人幾乎都不喜歡去醫院的 , 反之越怕死的人越想時常進出醫院 , 卻反而死得越快 , 此人瑞如果不喜歡喝咖啡 , 就不會有胃的問題 , 沒有子女的強烈壓力也不會去醫院的 , 一般人以為此人瑞是年事已高所以手術後立刻死亡 , 殊不知半年前有名的\"BEE GEES\"合唱團的鍵盤手Morries Gibs正是因為小腸套結在一起 , 結果到邁阿密醫院開刀 , 當場就死在手術臺上 , 得年54歲 . 此案例絕對不是因為年齡過大而死的 , 那又如何說呢?"}]},{"ID":"20240521154702-tg5nq69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154702-tg5nq69","updated":"20240521154702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   如果此人是性喜喝茶 , 不喝咖啡的話 , 絕對不會有胃痛的 , 可免一死 ."}]},{"ID":"20240521154702-4wi3l7o","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154702-4wi3l7o"}},{"ID":"20240521154710-kxdfsos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154710-kxdfsos","updated":"20240521154711"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"111歲日本人田鍋獲全球最長壽男人認定書"}]},{"ID":"20240521154710-zu711f6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154710-zu711f6","updated":"20240521154710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2007/06/18 16:19"}]},{"ID":"20240521154710-xcekuq6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154710-xcekuq6","updated":"20240521154710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（中央社記者楊明珠東京十八日專電）一百一十一歲的日本人田鍋友時，今天正式收到金氏紀錄認證通知書，認定他為全球最長壽的男性人瑞。他說長壽的秘訣就是不要喝酒。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(他忘記說到他從未吃西藥與維他命。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154710-lf01lq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154710-lf01lq0","updated":"20240521154710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田鍋的居住地日本宮崎縣都城市的市長長峰誠今天將日前從英國寄來的金氏紀錄認定書送到田鍋家中，親手交給他，並向他致賀。認定書記載，一百一十一歲的田鍋是全球最長壽的人瑞。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154710-ap5l0ey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154710-ap5l0ey","updated":"20240521154710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田鍋取代了今年一月二十四日去世的波多黎各一百一十五歲男性人瑞，成為全球最長壽的人瑞。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154710-3myp3px","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154710-3myp3px","updated":"20240521154710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田鍋生於一八九五年九月十八日，年輕時是都城市公所的土木技師，辭去該職務之後，專心務農。他有八名子女，二十五名孫子和五十一名曾孫、三名玄孫。他目前與六十六歲的五男夫婦同住。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154710-q38gh2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154710-q38gh2l","updated":"20240521154710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田鍋除了耳朵有些重聽，健康方面都沒問題。數十年來，他習慣閱讀報紙、寫日記。今天被大批記者問到長壽的秘訣時說：「總之，不要喝酒就是了」。他口齒清晰地說：「我還不想死呢！」"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(所以長壽的人瑞，至今為止，無一人是因為喜歡吃西藥與維他命而長壽的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154710-praii9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154710-praii9v","updated":"20240521154710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今年一月二十八日，住在日本南部福岡縣福智町、一百一十四歲的皆川米子，也獲得美國的老人學研究組織認定是全球最長壽的女人瑞。因此，全球最長壽的男女人瑞的寶座全都由日本人包辦了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154710-9l56601","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154710-9l56601","updated":"20240521154710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154710-yi9lrh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154710-yi9lrh3","updated":"20240521154710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   日本是島國，人民每天吃"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"海藻與海帶"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，這是對人體最好的食物，處此環境中再加上每天保持開心，他們當然長壽。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154710-kcyb2qt","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154710-kcyb2qt"}},{"ID":"20240521154719-53bl3ky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154719-53bl3ky","updated":"20240521154721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"歐洲最老人111歲長壽之道：遠離煙酒避縱慾"}]},{"ID":"20240521154719-yy5ujdj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154719-yy5ujdj","updated":"20240521154719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2007/06/07 19:54"}]},{"ID":"20240521154719-47764rz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154719-47764rz","updated":"20240521154719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（中央社記者黃貞貞倫敦七日專電）歐洲最年長的人瑞，英國最資深的第一次世界大戰老將艾陵愛姆昨天歡度一百十一歲生日。他談到長壽的秘訣時說，遠離煙酒，避免縱慾美色，保持樂觀心情，凡事適可而止，盡情擁抱人生；至於他最大的願望則是，希望有一部電動輪椅車代步。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這位長壽人瑞是我們應該效法的對象，因為要上人紀課，我將抽煙的惡習戒掉，免得影響我上課的發音，所以我可以多活很多年了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154719-xr07k8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154719-xr07k8r","updated":"20240521154719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"艾陵愛姆在家人的圍繞下，歡度第一百一十個生日。被問到感覺如何？他說：「我很高興又看到另一個明天，能活著真好，我希望能有機會再繼續慶祝生日，我從來沒有想到自己能活到這把年紀」。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(真開心啊！)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154719-x1lx35v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154719-x1lx35v","updated":"20240521154719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"被問到長壽的秘訣時，艾陵愛姆表示，不抽煙，不喝烈酒，也不縱慾於美色，同時保持好的幽默感，凡事適可而止，可以做些運動，但要量力而為，不要過頭。(讀者看他有說多吃西藥與維他命嗎。)"}]},{"ID":"20240521154719-w6jx61h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154719-w6jx61h","updated":"20240521154719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他說，現在很多人喪失幽默感，以過於嚴肅的態度看待人生，「我總是儘量保持微笑，輕鬆看人生，如果我可以活這麼長，你也可以辦的到」。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這就是真正長壽秘訣所在，西醫學是用盡方法讓病人驚懼害怕，所以相信西醫學的人，結果都死於非命。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154719-a5gof0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154719-a5gof0r","updated":"20240521154719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一九一六年艾陵愛姆加入英國皇家海軍並參加日德蘭戰役；一九一八年轉往皇家空軍服役。皇家海軍特別在朴茨茅斯港的維多利亞戰艦上為他舉行慶生活動，海軍陸戰隊樂隊並為他演奏生日快樂歌。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154719-va2g9lf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154719-va2g9lf","updated":"20240521154719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"艾陵愛姆胸前掛著勳章，神情十分愉快，他說：「今天我覺得很年輕，我真的難以置信，我希望能有一部電動輪椅車代步，不過至少今天我收到女王的賀卡」。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154719-tv670p6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154719-tv670p6","updated":"20240521154719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"艾陵愛姆目前有六個孫子女，十二個曾孫子女，十三個玄孫子女，及一個玄玄孫。他的許多親人定居在美國，都特別趕到英國為他祝壽。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(真幸福啊！)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154719-v9s08mu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154719-v9s08mu","updated":"20240521154719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154719-qkx2ctb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154719-qkx2ctb","updated":"20240521154719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"   讀者看這篇報導中這位長壽人瑞是否很開心"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，真正人能夠不生病的原因是每天都開心，永遠保持赤子之心，無憂無懼的過日子，但是有一惡魔卻不這麼想，它們是來自地獄，它們希望世上人人都有病，一個沒有病的人出現，它們是無法接受的，於是研發出許多可以製造疾病的機器與藥物出來，利用人類善良無知的天性，極盡的醜化細菌與病毒與癌症等，讓人們心中產生恐懼，於是就任其宰割，死前還將所有一生的積蓄，通通交給西藥廠，然後死的很痛苦，死前還跟殺死他的西說聲謝謝。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154719-o9bgpsg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154719-o9bgpsg","updated":"20240521154719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"結論是 : "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"直到目前為止，世界上所有的人瑞，無一人說其長壽是因為每天吃西藥與維他命而造成的，聰明的讀者認為是不是呢？"}]},{"ID":"20240521154722-ipdx0oh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154722-ipdx0oh"}},{"ID":"20240521154729-3ee5xq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154729-3ee5xq9","updated":"20240521154731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"123歲胡業妹 身體仍硬朗"}]},{"ID":"20240521154729-k80yk4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154729-k80yk4u","updated":"20240521154729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【聯合報╱記者陳嘉信／台東報導】2008.04.21 03:31 am"}]},{"ID":"20240521154729-vykpmqn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154729-vykpmqn","updated":"20240521154729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可能是全台戶籍年齡第二高的台東縣延平鄉紅葉村123歲的胡業妹，因行動不便，家屬今年初將她送到台東養護中心照顧，也不願外界打擾她，曾探望過她的延平鄉公所祕書胡榮典說，阿嬤除重聽及器官退化以輪椅代步外，身體仍硬朗。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (讀者看到沒有，她住在深山裡，不在城市。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154729-yrjshhl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154729-yrjshhl","updated":"20240521154729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"布農族「姆拉斯」的胡業妹是前延平鄉長胡武仁的姑婆，新身分證上是民前26年2月10日生。照顧她的孫姪媳婦邱秀英說，姑婆年齡紀錄可能是一場美麗的錯誤。據家中老一輩人回憶說，光復後姆拉斯的姊姊過世，戶政人員誤把她的名字塗銷，姆拉斯就繼承了大姊的漢名，變成了「胡業妹」。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154729-nkd2vo6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154729-nkd2vo6","updated":"20240521154729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"至於姆拉斯到底是幾歲，她本人也答不出來。姆拉斯只知道自己是小米收割的時節出生的；但是哪一年的小米，就沒人在乎了。姆拉斯則以布農族母語答說，她的年紀就像桶中的水「已經溢出來了」。 (真可愛啊。)"}]},{"ID":"20240521154729-4cja7hf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154729-4cja7hf","updated":"20240521154729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"邱秀英說，姆拉斯以前飲食習慣粗茶淡飯，不挑食，早睡早起，行動方便時常趕鴨、洗碗、揀菜、曬衣等家事，並有有嚼檳榔及抽菸的習慣。 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(我早就說過，抽煙跟嚼檳榔與肺癌喉癌無關，可能跟口腔癌有關些。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154729-ui20xzm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154729-ui20xzm","updated":"20240521154729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胡業妹現在年歲已大，沒牙齒，加上3年前在家不慎跌倒右腿骨折，經診斷心肺功能差，因此戒菸，也不嚼檳榔了，開刀後因行動不方便，需以輪椅代步。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(三年前才戒煙與戒檳榔，還是很硬朗啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154729-th26p3t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154729-th26p3t","updated":"20240521154729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154729-sewusln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154729-sewusln","updated":"20240521154729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    此人會長壽，因為從小就沒有什麼各種的疫苗要接種，更沒有什麼現在缺貨中的六合一疫苗，感冒也沒有抗生素，一生勤儉，吃的簡單，勞力工作多，山中空氣又好，水質又沒有污染，也看不到令人作嘔的新聞，只知自己養了三隻小豬，也不罵人髒話，因為沒有對象，也沒惡鄰居，也沒有長舌婦之類的朋友，於是每天心情都愉快，所有看到聽到說的，都是美的事情，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"她的地方是被西藥廠與政客們遺忘的地方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因為當地沒有錢賺，這就是她能長壽的真正原因所在啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154732-ianynvc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154732-ianynvc"}},{"ID":"20240521154738-fk52nkt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154738-fk52nkt","updated":"20240521154740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"英國研究：高齡產婦老化慢且較長壽【中央社 】"}]},{"ID":"20240521154738-nqqa254","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154738-nqqa254","updated":"20240521154738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（中央社記者黃貞貞倫敦二十五日專電）根據英國的最新研究，年紀較大生育子女的婦女，不僅更年期延後到來，罹患老人痴呆症的機率降低，而且較長壽。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是穩合中醫的看法,所以一直在戀愛中的女子是最長壽健康的.)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n英國「每日電訊報」報導，根據科學家進行的動物實驗，發現高齡生子可以讓女性持續製造女性賀爾蒙，例如雌激素等，延後更年期的來臨，加上她們在晚年時性生活仍十分活躍，身體狀況相對較健康，也較不易罹患老人痴呆症。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是正確的.)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n根據統計，二零零四年英格蘭與威爾斯地區約有兩萬三千名婦女，年過四十才懷孕，「高齡產婦」已是普遍的現象。曼徹斯特大學一名研究人類老化的專家史克爾頓說，「現代的嬰兒潮在年紀較大時才生子是一項正確的做法，因為證據顯示，愈晚生小孩，可以活得愈久」。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154738-tenxrln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154738-tenxrln","updated":"20240521154738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"史克爾頓指出，女人在三十歲後體內的雌激素會大量減少，在年紀較大時孕育第一胎，將可因此大量製造雌激素，不論是肌肉、骨骼或神經系統都將因此而獲益。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154738-m98if9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154738-m98if9r","updated":"20240521154738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她說，男性和女性在年紀增長後，體內的十一酸睪酮量都會減少，但是如果有健康的性生活，可以製造更多十一酸睪酮，有助維持心血管健康。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154738-a1efayj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154738-a1efayj","updated":"20240521154738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"報導說，最近其它的研究也指出，女性在三十五歲生完最後一胎，較那些年紀較輕時生產的女性，死亡風險降低百分之二十八。但是不少醫師認為，高齡產婦生產事實上存有不少風險。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154738-l9328x8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154738-l9328x8","updated":"20240521154738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154738-y222ypr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154738-y222ypr","updated":"20240521154738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  這報告是正確的.我常說如果女子得到乳癌的話,先生要負責任的,如果先生一直很疼愛太太,一直疼ㄚ寵ㄚ的,這世界上就沒有女人會得到乳癌的."}]},{"ID":"20240521154738-u9h4kra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154738-u9h4kra","updated":"20240521154738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"結論是: "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"除了性生活以外,愛心更重要,一定要讓太太感受到你誠執的愛心,如此我保證你太太不會得到乳癌的,也包括子宮卵巢癌在內."}]},{"ID":"20240521154738-lbe5qwa","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154738-lbe5qwa"}},{"ID":"20240521154752-date68q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154752-date68q","updated":"20240521154800"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"105歲母顧盲兒 74年不離棄"}]},{"ID":"20240521154757-v2u3jyf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154757-v2u3jyf","updated":"20240521154757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2006.10.21　 中國時報\n康日昇/南縣報導"}]},{"ID":"20240521154752-zmeuevl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154752-zmeuevl","updated":"20240521154752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"高齡一百零五歲人瑞林楊鴛，照顧自幼即眼盲的兒子林清池長達七十四年，展現慈母無盡的愛，母子相依為命，早晚相伴不離不棄，地方傳為佳話，台南縣長蘇煥智近日將前往探望，祝賀這對母子重陽節快樂。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (讀者看出什麼真理隱藏其中嗎?)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154752-jxnprim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154752-jxnprim","updated":"20240521154752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 世居佳里鎮子龍里的林楊鴛，因家境貧困，兒子林清池四歲時發高燒，沒有錢看醫生而延誤治療，導致雙眼失明，讓林楊鴛相當自責，並決心要照顧眼盲兒子一生一世。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (家貧是她長壽原因ㄚ，小孩發高燒對中醫而言是最簡單不過，大椎放血，十宣放血，當場燒就退，不需要花大錢吃沒用的抗生素。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154752-jv1hf1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154752-jv1hf1j","updated":"20240521154752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    眼盲的林清池，幼年時完全沒有生活自理能力，林楊鴛照顧他非常辛苦，擔心他眼睛看不見會跌倒撞傷，更擔心他到處亂爬，萬一爬出家門會不見了，林楊鴛視線幾乎一刻都不能離開他，深怕一不留神，又會造成不可彌補的傷害。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(心中有事牽掛放不下.)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154752-rpp3osh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154752-rpp3osh","updated":"20240521154752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"林楊鴛早年靠丈夫林謀外出打零工勉強維持家計，當年有丈夫可依靠，她還可以在家全心照顧眼盲兒子，丈夫後來病故，她的生活更難過，必須自己出門打零工賺錢養家，當她要外出工作前，會先餵飽兒子，再將午餐飯菜放在桌上，讓已摸熟家中環境的兒子中午肚子餓了自行取食。 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(只能吃最簡單的食物，沒錢去買維他命補身，當然沒錢繳健保，也沒錢看醫師，當然沒錢每年去做體檢，還要花體力去打工賺錢 ，她卻萬萬沒想到這就是她長壽的真正原因所在。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154752-nybmje1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154752-nybmje1","updated":"20240521154752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    林楊鴛年齡越來越大，已沒有體力打零工，只能靠低收入戶濟助款，省吃儉用勉強度日，後來由里長及里幹事協助為兒子申請眼盲殘障補助，但補助金額還是有限，母子倆都要勒緊腰帶。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (沒錢是她長壽的主因，因為買正餐錢都不夠，遑論再買鈣片跟善存等爛維他命。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154752-6ineupv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154752-6ineupv","updated":"20240521154752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 照顧眼盲兒子長達七十四年的林楊鴛，兩萬七千餘個日子朝夕相處，林楊鴛對已七十八歲的兒子始終不離不棄，雖然她高齡一百零五歲，但身體相當健康，只有老年人的重聽毛病，以前她都自己煮三餐餵養兒子，一年前縣府開始推動獨居老人送餐服務，才省去老人家煮食的不便。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (這裡無意間說出此婦人105歲，但是身體健康，這就是科學證據，她的長壽證明我是對的，西醫藥是錯誤的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154752-wlgb0eh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154752-wlgb0eh","updated":"20240521154752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    林楊鴛與兒子棲身於老舊矮屋內，炎炎夏日沒有冷氣機可吹，只能吹電風扇，偶有鄰居訪客都覺得酷熱難當，但母子兩人習以為常，不怨天尤人，過著清苦的日子，或許這就是林楊鴛長壽的秘訣，但她自認長壽原因是為了照顧「歹命兒子」，因為她若先死了，眼盲兒子要由誰照顧呢？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (現代所謂的文明到底是帶給人們短命呢?還是歹命呢?)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154752-jrb3h8e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154752-jrb3h8e","updated":"20240521154752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    林清池對照顧他一輩子的母親滿懷感恩，由於他已摸熟住家內外環境，現在日常生活都盡量自理，有時還會反過來照顧體力日益衰弱的母親，他希望年齡越來越大的母親，能由他「摸索照顧」安度晚年，他更祈求來生有緣能再做家人，讓他能夠回報母親的恩情。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154752-6h67oci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154752-6h67oci","updated":"20240521154752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論   "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154752-tbgbdxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154752-tbgbdxo","updated":"20240521154752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這篇報導太好了，我ㄧ直在說大家不要有錢，越有錢就越短命，因為有錢人就是西藥廠的目標，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"西藥廠知道有錢人就怕短命"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，於是西藥廠不斷的給這些有錢人洗腦，盡吃些無效又害人的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"鈣片(蓋騙)跟維他命(要你命)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，於是近代人活的很短，大家注意一下，家中年紀在30歲到70歲之間的人最短命，因為這段時間受到西藥廠蓬勃發展的影響最大，所以大都被洗腦，相信西藥廠的後果就是死於癌症，死於西藥廠所製造出來的疾病，我常說"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"曾祖父與曾孫的故事，幾乎我們(指30到70歲之間的人)所有家裡的曾祖父與祖父輩都長壽，因為他們的時代沒有如此眾多的西藥廠存在，所以吃的簡單，住的環境也沒有冷氣電梯等，所以人人每天都有許多勞動要做，因此都生活的跟上面這位長壽貧窮婦人一樣，所以他們都長壽"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，反觀現代人的生活，家家有冷氣，人人吃好的同時還在飯後再吃許多各種維他命，台灣還有些家庭在宴客後，端上桌的居然是最新出品的維他命，主人還向朋友們炫耀說他多有本事，在台灣尚未上市的他都有，還以此為榮，真正是在找死，這種笨蛋很多，處處都有，這就是他們短命的原因，我早就說過在台灣一位馬路邊的無業遊民都可以活的比台大醫院的醫師還長壽，這已經是科學證據証明西藥是害人短命，害人生病的毒藥，請大家多多學習這些貧苦的長壽人，我保證你只要學他們如何過日子，你一定健康長壽，毫無病痛的。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154752-7ee14lo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154752-7ee14lo","updated":"20240521154752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"結論 : 不要相信西醫衛生署公佈的死亡率，那是西藥廠用來騙人的數據，上面這篇才是真正真實的數據。這是中醫衛生署說的。如果有笨蛋說上篇是我編的故事，請去罵這位報導記者，因為他是見證人。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154801-wsu18kk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154801-wsu18kk"}},{"ID":"20240521154807-kp8xacn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154807-kp8xacn","updated":"20240521154808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"102歲李變 11年未用健保卡"}]},{"ID":"20240521154807-ai0fj7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154807-ai0fj7y","updated":"20240521154807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"聯合報／記者牟玉珮／基隆報導】"}]},{"ID":"20240521154807-mc4gy21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154807-mc4gy21","updated":"20240521154807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基隆巿七堵區六堵里長蘇財發昨天趕在九九重陽節前，向里內最高齡的102歲人瑞李變祝壽，她健康長壽，兒孫滿堂，11年來沒用過健保卡，每天還替賣菜的媳婦挑菜葉，鄰居笑稱吃她的菜可「呷百二」。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (這就是科學證據，證明不去醫院做體檢就是真長壽的原因。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154807-9qn663f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154807-9qn663f","updated":"20240521154807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"六堵里長蘇財發從3年前李變100歲時，每年重陽節都送一面金盤給她祝壽，昨天上午他把「福如東海、壽比南山」的紀念金盤送到李變家，李家兒孫陪在身旁，也很歡喜五代同堂，祝福已是「高祖」輩的她，健健康康活到120歲。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (中醫對於人的壽命多長，早有說明，平均是一百二十歲才對，所以長壽是正常的，現在西藥廠介入這原本是上帝的管轄區，並將之破壞，於是人們的壽命才會變短。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154807-7tukabw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154807-7tukabw","updated":"20240521154807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"李變除了重聽，身體依然硬朗，每天一早還坐在工建路自家門口前挑菜，給媳婦帶到七堵巿場賣；她的曾孫女張瑞庭昨天拿出一張去年3月中央健保局寄來的感謝狀，感謝李變身體健康、10年沒用健保卡。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (看到了嗎? 這十年不用健保卡就是長壽的證據了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154807-y7vyvb0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154807-y7vyvb0","updated":"20240521154807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"張瑞庭說，阿祖身體很好，每天爬樓梯，大概因為早睡早起、規律的生活及年輕時多勞動，才會這麼健康長壽，她雖年紀大，也沒忌口，三餐正常，愛啃雞翅膀、豬腳，眼力還很好，縫補衣服，都自己來。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (勤勞不偷懶，生活規律，無過多慾望，因此長壽)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154807-v1zr9ex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154807-v1zr9ex","updated":"20240521154807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"李變昨天聽人家稱讚她健康長壽很高興，說她以前還幫人家免費接生，里長蘇財發也說，李變以前替人縫喪衣，還替娶親的鄰人「牽新婦」、「包生子」，做了很多好事積了德，才會兒孫滿堂，多福氣。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154807-s3ztg45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154807-s3ztg45","updated":"20240521154807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154807-za9j45d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154807-za9j45d","updated":"20240521154807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   讀者看看這上下兩篇有關長壽人瑞的報導中有一共同點，就是完全沒有出現西藥與維他命，這就是不生病又長壽的真正原因了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154807-yhs41vf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154807-yhs41vf"}},{"ID":"20240521154814-kdm2i3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154814-kdm2i3l","updated":"20240521154816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"101歲阿嬤下廚 請市長吃早餐"}]},{"ID":"20240521154814-35h06wt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154814-35h06wt","updated":"20240521154814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳳山市101歲的張王粟玉，昨天到市場買地瓜葉，下廚炒菜、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"煮番薯粥"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，分享市長許智傑等人，兩人以阿嬤、乖孫互稱，許智傑希望阿嬤能成為鳳山健康城市的代言人。阿嬤要他明年帶孫媳婦一起來作客。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154814-alclvnl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154814-alclvnl","updated":"20240521154814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"重陽節前，許智傑向張王粟玉致意，兩人約定昨天一起吃早餐，市民代表黃柱花、李美雲、中正里里長申春輝陪同前往，看張王粟玉還能下廚、端菜，用完瓦斯還知道要關瓦斯，在場的人都稱，阿嬤太厲害了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154814-7898dla","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154814-7898dla","updated":"20240521154814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳳山市有八位百歲人瑞，六位女性、兩位男性，張王粟玉耳聰目明，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"每天自己煮地瓜粥吃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，她沒有讀過書，年輕時務農，每天早上五點起床，下田工作，長久以來都保持運動，現在沒有牙齒，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"幾乎三餐都吃番薯粥"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，很注意身體健康的概念，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不重口味，只吃7、8分飽，不看電視。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154814-ztx453o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154814-ztx453o","updated":"20240521154814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阿嬤說，知道市長要和她吃早餐，前天晚上就高興得睡不著，半夜起來好幾次看時間，因為客廳沒有冷氣，她為市長準備了毛巾，大家在吃早餐時，阿嬤市長用毛巾擦汗；許智傑則為阿嬤夾菜、添粥，場面相當溫馨。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154814-ylqhbyh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154814-ylqhbyh","updated":"20240521154814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154814-je9l39p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154814-je9l39p","updated":"20240521154814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   這位人瑞之所以長壽，就是我用紅字註明的重點，吃番薯粥是最養生最健康的食物了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154814-w4pa49g","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154814-w4pa49g"}},{"ID":"20240521154831-98f3u0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154831-98f3u0n","updated":"20240521154834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"遼寧108歲女人瑞 自己穿衣自己縫"}]},{"ID":"20240521154824-57klasp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154824-57klasp","updated":"20240521154832"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2006.05.05　 今日晚報\n中央社"}]},{"ID":"20240521154824-jtst24o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154824-jtst24o","updated":"20240521154824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她今年一百零八歲，是遼寧岫巖最年長的老人，卻沒有名字，兒孫們叫她「老太太」，鄰居稱她「於王氏」。據報導，於王氏雖然年事已高，卻能自理生活，身上穿的衣服都是自己親手所縫製。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154824-russljm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154824-russljm","updated":"20240521154824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遼寧「千山晚報」報導，老人的家族中長壽者很多，是個名副其實的長壽之家，親姊妹七個，「最不能活的」也活了九十歲。\n報導說，老人一頭銀髮，身體彎得像魚鉤，盤腿一坐，一對三寸金蓮特別引人注目。由於年輕時做得一手好針線，現在眼雖花了，卻還能紉針，「因為常年做針線活，熟能生巧中已經練成一種神奇的直覺。」"}]},{"ID":"20240521154824-qyiwd06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154824-qyiwd06","updated":"20240521154824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"老人的家人說，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"老太太長壽是因為心寬"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，她一生經歷過一次又一次白髮人送黑髮人的打擊：老伴在她五十歲時餓死，死時肚子瘦得只剩一張皮；六十歲時，才二十歲的兒媳婦生病去世；不久十八歲的女兒也過去；隨後大兒子也去世，現在只剩一個七十一歲的二兒子。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154824-3yu0153","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154824-3yu0153","updated":"20240521154824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154824-6gk5zy2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154824-6gk5zy2","updated":"20240521154824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   全篇透漏出一個真理,就是她之所以能長壽的原因就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"寬心"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二字而已,試問西醫師們,你們是讓病人寬心呢? 還是擔心呢? 你們得手段讓病人失去生活重心,完全沒有生活品質可言,結果就是病人短命,都因為心臟被懗出病來而死掉的,根本不是因為癌症而死的."}]},{"ID":"20240521154824-pjmy2n7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154824-pjmy2n7"}},{"ID":"20240521154845-quajaqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154845-quajaqe","updated":"20240521154847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"老人山居30年沒水電"}]},{"ID":"20240521154841-2cz3u3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154841-2cz3u3w","updated":"20240521154846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2006.10.28　 中國時報\n何醒邦╱汐止報導"}]},{"ID":"20240521154841-9ozaag6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154841-9ozaag6","updated":"20240521154841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"汐止水源路2段的山區，一位82歲的老人，獨自住在山區內一幢5坪大的石屋裡，過著猶如原始人般的生活，沒電、沒有衛浴設備，餓了就自己生火煮菜，配合簡單的山泉水，與世隔絕住了30年。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (這裡的與世隔絕就是沒有西藥，沒有維他命，沒有疫苗，沒有每年的體檢，大家同意嗎?)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154841-spmi0z9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154841-spmi0z9","updated":"20240521154841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"重陽節前夕，立法委員沈發惠與汐止扶輪社一同慰問這名82歲的獨居老人沈受，隨行人員將車開至汐止水源路2段的山區，再以徒步方式，走20分鐘狹窄蜿蜒的山路，才能到達沈受的住所。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154841-9qpkssx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154841-9qpkssx","updated":"20240521154841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"善士助建石屋 與世隔絕"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (我們不須要為了長壽而與世隔絕，大家只要與西醫藥隔絕就會長壽了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154841-b8dupve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154841-b8dupve","updated":"20240521154841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"當地的白雲裡里長陳俊地說，沈受是雲林人，30年前被雇來開墾汐止山區的農作物，後來因為這塊地不具農耕價值，農工們紛紛離開，沈受因為習慣當地的生活，又沒有結婚、膝下無子，就這樣住了下來，而且一住就是30年。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154841-sovtxcp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154841-sovtxcp","updated":"20240521154841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陳俊地表示，七十九年間，他上山看到一間只用帆布覆蓋在柱子上面的破舊工寮，當時沈受與兩隻狗窩在裡面，他想「這怎麼住人？」就與當地人士買了一些建材、日用品，協助沈受搭建現在住的石屋。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154841-68c8kwd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154841-68c8kwd","updated":"20240521154841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"靠領年金過活 淡泊寡慾"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (這就是長壽的開始。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154841-z733bmt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154841-z733bmt","updated":"20240521154841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"長期關注社區老人的汐止農會家政推廣股義工林麗雲說，八十八年汐止農會前來探視，發現沈受這裡沒有水，便請人幫他接山泉水，後來慈濟的人為他蓋了水塔。她說，去年有一隻狗陪他，可以預防晚上睡覺時被毒蛇咬，今年不知何故狗跑了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154841-egzfbmp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154841-egzfbmp","updated":"20240521154841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"當地人都知道沈受靠老人年金過活，約1個星期會下山補貨一次，但常有善心人士帶東西給他吃。林麗雲說，他也將自己種的芋頭、蘿蔔、青菜，隨便混在一起煮來吃，旁人也不知裡頭是什麼，因為他非常隨性，能吃飽就好，物質需求不高。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154841-749wc5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154841-749wc5e","updated":"20240521154841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"喜歡人陪聊天 堅拒下山。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這裡說明了此人根本不曾下山，當然也沒有健保，也沒有每年體檢，更沒有打流感疫苗，凡是這些被西醫衛生署遺忘的人，其共同點就是"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"長壽"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154841-0v5vx68","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154841-0v5vx68","updated":"20240521154841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"萬里的仁愛之家曾邀請他去住，但他就是不願意。也有好心民眾試圖騙沈受下山說：「這裡沒水沒電，鬼又多，在你旁邊叫，你都沒看到嗎？」沒想到沈受回說：「鬼也在你旁邊叫啊，你都不怕了，我怕什麼。」說什麼就是不肯離開。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (此人必然命中註定要長壽，所以無論誰勸他都無效，就是不下山，下山就活不過幾年的，必然被西醫整死。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154841-n7uxhzk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154841-n7uxhzk","updated":"20240521154841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"沈受除了有點駝背，身體狀況還算不錯，天氣好時還會自行除草。林麗雲說，他最需要的應該是有人陪他聊天，昨天是她看過沈受話最多的一次，還跟大家一起唱歌，「我想老人應該最想要人陪伴吧。」"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這句話對一半，應該說是他最須要的是有人陪他一起住在山上。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154841-nyvxz0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154841-nyvxz0w","updated":"20240521154841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154841-rvh1zzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154841-rvh1zzt","updated":"20240521154841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"目前世界上只要發現長壽人瑞時，請大家注意一下，該人必定有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"四大共同特徵"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":",第一 : 被西藥廠遺忘的人，第二 : 必然是堅拒使用西藥的人，第三 : 從不去做體檢的人，第四 : 被當地衛生局遺忘的人，你只要屬於上述四點的人，你就註定會長壽的。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154841-7auj68m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154841-7auj68m","updated":"20240521154841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"結論是 :"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"台灣所有的人民生活條件都遠超過此人， 但是卻沒有此人長壽健康跟開心，主要原因就是台灣衛生署提倡西醫，發揚西醫,於是才讓西醫院與西藥商勾結在一起，大賺黑心錢，因為衛生署的推波助瀾， 人民當然相信，於是人人短命，使得生活物資條件高於此人的一一過世，壽命反而不如此人長，為了大眾的健康長壽，我能不終結西藥廠嗎?"}]},{"ID":"20240521154841-zoi0li1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154841-zoi0li1"}},{"ID":"20240521154902-5we0cen","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154902-5we0cen","updated":"20240521154904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"台灣百寶鄉 離亂又重逢 人瑞夫妻牽手80年"}]},{"ID":"20240521154854-5dx2cvn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154854-5dx2cvn","updated":"20240521154854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【聯合報／記者許俊傑／潭子報導】"}]},{"ID":"20240521154854-0dp1icp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154854-0dp1icp","updated":"20240521154854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"台中縣潭子鄉葉展玉、葉曾亞姬夫婦，今年分已101歲、99歲高齡，合起來剛好200歲，夫妻牽手近80年，兩人是指腹為婚，一同走過戰亂，嘗盡骨肉分離的痛苦，也見證台灣的繁榮，更是「百年好合」的最佳寫照。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154854-1z5b3bg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154854-1z5b3bg","updated":"20240521154854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葉展玉生於廣東省老隆縣，家境小康，從小好學，民國初年大陸政局動盪，但他仍畢業於廣州中山大學農業系，為當時社會菁英，已故前副總統謝東閔是他的學長。民國34年台灣光復，他受謝東閔之邀到台灣，協助台糖公司接收日據時代的製糖會社。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154854-wwie1ru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154854-wwie1ru","updated":"20240521154854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"民國38年大陸淪陷，不識字的葉曾亞姬冒著危險，帶著兒子來台灣找丈夫，但留下兩個女兒在大陸，從此一家人分隔兩地，成為葉展玉心中最大的遺憾。所幸民國70年代政府開放探親，兩名女兒在夫婦八十多歲時，曾來台探視兩老，讓二個女兒終於釋懷，一家人也團圓了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154854-hco0nej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154854-hco0nej","updated":"20240521154854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葉展玉來台後，在台糖台中廠擔任工程師，對推動糖業發展貢獻良多，55年退休後，還一度受邀到馬來西亞技術指導糖廠經營，5年後返回，才真正退休。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154854-ijmt01m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154854-ijmt01m","updated":"20240521154854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"談及牽手近80年的相處，葉展玉仍擺出一副「好男不跟女鬥」的樣子。他說，不要看葉曾亞姬身材嬌小，兩人有口角，幾都是她在一旁碎碎念，待她說累了，再一起牽手散步，從不拌嘴，反正「老婆永遠是對的」。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154854-engjxcr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154854-engjxcr","updated":"20240521154854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昨天是重陽節，潭子鄉長簡文祥、縣議員蕭進益等人攜帶禮品，前往頭家東村向籍設台中市，但已在潭子鄉住超過十多年的「鄉寶」祝賀。簡文祥說，只要住在鄉內就是一家人，也向兩老選擇潭子鄉養老，表達謝意。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154854-sw6xp9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154854-sw6xp9w","updated":"20240521154854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"頭家村長劉進福表示，葉展玉夫婦雖都已百歲，身體仍十分硬朗，葉展玉因日前摔傷坐輪椅，但在輔具支撐下也能行走；葉曾亞姬則是每天早晚都會在村內運動，體力還相當好，牙齒也很健康，還能"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"啃甘蔗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，真是「老康健」。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154854-8d96d4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154854-8d96d4t","updated":"20240521154854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154854-qkuj6sd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154854-qkuj6sd","updated":"20240521154854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   我一直在說台糖沒落是最可惜的事，上面這位台糖公司退休的工程師一生吃甘蔗，所以到老年紀百歲時，牙齒都是很完整的，居然還可以啃甘蔗，這裡得到證明了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154905-ysqu2z4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154905-ysqu2z4"}},{"ID":"20240521154910-ul6skde","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154910-ul6skde","updated":"20240521154910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"重慶114歲老太太養生：每天方城戰四小時"}]},{"ID":"20240521154910-wwj5tsl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154910-wwj5tsl","updated":"20240521154910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2006/11/06 04:00"}]},{"ID":"20240521154910-3ezkiyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154910-3ezkiyu","updated":"20240521154910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    四川重慶一位人瑞老太太「范秀英」，雖然高齡114歲，但是身體硬朗、臉色紅潤，思路清晰；她透露，養生之道在於粗茶淡飯，不斷勞動作家事，她每天飯前喝一小杯養生藥酒，每天下午搓麻將四小時，鏖戰方城之間，樂此不疲。\n   范老太太不願麻煩兒孫，一人獨居，凡是起居飲食全都自理。她的牌友說，范老太太打牌時思路清晰，出牌快，要贏她的錢還不容易呢！\n   當地醫療專家指出，范老太太長壽的主要原因在於生活規律，飲食不挑剔、經常勞動、與人交流，尤其打麻將鍛鍊腦力，防止罹患老年癡呆症。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(此地醫療專家說錯話，世界上原本沒有老人痴呆這病的，是病人吃太多西藥造成的，所以是西藥廠所製造出來的疾病，只有遠離西藥才是預防得到此病的唯一方式。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154910-00azqn8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154910-00azqn8","updated":"20240521154910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154910-zbvjcc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154910-zbvjcc1","updated":"20240521154910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     這就是活生生的科學證據，舉凡世上能長壽之人都是不吃西藥的人，但是以後這些長壽人將會絕跡，因為現在西藥廠已經深入我中國領土中，正在殘害我中華子女，現在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大陸又出個混蛋叫做張功耀，是中南大學的一位教授教經濟學的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，此人居然提出要在五年之內將中醫完全踢出醫療體系，所持的理由是中醫不科學，這個破壞中國文化的敗類,第一: 他是教經濟學的，如果要做到使用最少的花費，又要得到最好的結果時，只有中醫藥是唯一選擇，中醫是最經濟又最有效的科學治療法，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以提倡西醫是最不經濟的選擇"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。第二 : 此人連"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"科學與科技的差異都搞不清楚，這種誤將科技當成科學的錯誤觀念"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，還拿出來丟人現眼，還要想禍害我們的子孫，真是不知道此人是怎麼讀書的，讀書卻讀成笨蛋，自己笨也就罷了，還要害人千年，真是惡質到極點。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154910-rxvjld3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154910-rxvjld3","updated":"20240521154910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"結論是 : "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"許多中醫已經在害中醫沒落了,現在又跑出個不懂中醫的經濟學家來迫害中醫,中醫有這麼讓人痛恨嗎? 我們中醫有得罪你們嗎? 為何不遺餘力的要消滅中醫呢?"}]},{"ID":"20240521154910-yxojpe2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154910-yxojpe2"}},{"ID":"20240521154922-vn6ywe4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154922-vn6ywe4","updated":"20240521154922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"研究發現 情緒穩定積極有助長壽"}]},{"ID":"20240521154922-2m0uq5f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154922-2m0uq5f","updated":"20240521154922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2008/09/25 10:02"}]},{"ID":"20240521154922-lunt8zq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154922-lunt8zq","updated":"20240521154922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（中央社記者張蕙燕亞特蘭大二十四日專電）根據一項長逾五十年的調查研究指出，具有情緒穩定、個性活潑積極等人格特質的人，比起消極的人，壽命會較長。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(希望西醫不要再鬧了，這種研究也要做，真是笑死人的研究。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154922-6aqkhi3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154922-6aqkhi3","updated":"20240521154922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　這項刊登在「身心醫學雜誌」上的報告，是由美國國家老年研究所根據超過兩千三百人長達五十年以上的時間，追蹤研究每個人的人格特質與壽命之間的關係，並在最近發布研究結果。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(中國自古以來得道高僧都長命，就已經證明了這點，還需要西洋人來證明嗎。)(西醫既然已經知道這些，那為何還要嚇唬病人呢? 許多病人的情緒不穩定就是因為被西醫嚇到了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154922-c9wykih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154922-c9wykih","updated":"20240521154922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　研究結果顯示，人格特質與壽命長短具有決定性的關係，長壽的人擁有的人格特性包括情緒穩定、生活有條理與節制、處事認真、足智多謀，並且人生態度積極正面。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154922-d5an1c1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154922-d5an1c1","updated":"20240521154922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　相反的，較短命的人則是容易生氣、情緒不穩、焦躁、憂鬱等。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這些情緒上的問題，很多都是來自西藥的副作用造成的。像安眠藥的副作用就是憂鬱等。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154922-0q8plm5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154922-0q8plm5","updated":"20240521154922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　據了解，這個研究結果並非首次發現，二零零三年時「身心醫學雜誌」便曾刊登過類似研究。當時研究指出，具有喜好與他人計較、缺乏耐心、個性急躁等Ａ型性格特質的男性，比起其他型性格的人，身體健康受到的影響，較容易心臟病發作。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(真是廢話一堆。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154922-3ke135u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154922-3ke135u","updated":"20240521154922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　心理學家建議，如果發覺自己傾向封閉的Ａ型性格，可以尋找外力改善生活方式，如發掘新嗜好，培養散步、打太極拳、或瑜珈等運動習慣，尋求靈性生活的寄託，檢驗自己的職場生活等等。甚至還可以看心理醫生，找尋專業的建議。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(說了半天原來是要替心理醫師打廣告，想賣抗憂鬱藥物給大家吃，真是壞啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154922-qdf2bwk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154922-qdf2bwk","updated":"20240521154922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"真是笨拙的研究"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154922-1zhnp12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154922-1zhnp12","updated":"20240521154922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    由上面這篇報導中，我們可以知道，原來西醫師都知道這樣的做法會讓病人長壽，但是結果我們現在看到西醫的做法卻正好相反，西醫為了達到賺錢的目的，簡直是可以用不擇手段來形容，西醫最擅於嚇唬病人，讓病人緊張擔心，於是病人就任其宰割，死而後已，還有許多女性笨蛋，居然被西醫嚇到自願去切除雙乳，只為了不想得到乳癌而已，這篇正好說明，心情最重要，運動最重要，這才是長壽之道。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154922-o4d4sf6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154922-o4d4sf6"}},{"ID":"20240521154931-0c3odyh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154931-0c3odyh","updated":"20240521154933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"沒禁忌吃百二 黃海岱像個笑臉菩薩"}]},{"ID":"20240521154931-5wre6sn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154931-5wre6sn","updated":"20240521154931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2007/02/11【聯合報／本報記者李玉玲、蔡維斌】"}]},{"ID":"20240521154931-lz0kiuc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154931-lz0kiuc","updated":"20240521154931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"來，來去呷飯！」超過一世紀的人生行腳，黃海岱除了在布袋戲界留下難以取代的「教主」風範，最令後輩好友悵然的是：黃海岱永遠掛在嘴邊、熱情相邀的口頭禪，如今只能在回憶中追尋。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154931-ikucldz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154931-ikucldz","updated":"20240521154931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃海岱沒有獨特的養生之道，認為開朗認真、凡事不要想太多，常帶給人歡樂、自娛娛人，天天開心，就是長壽秘訣。愛吃重鹹的黃海岱曾說，「吃東西沒禁沒忌，吃百二，魯肥肉、米糕、炒米粉樣樣吃，台灣小吃我最愛。」 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這段已經很明確的說出他長壽的原因了，是天天開心。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154931-nmxqgfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154931-nmxqgfs","updated":"20240521154931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃海岱過世前已中風，右手不能動，但耳聰目明，只是說話有些口齒不清，不過當他手中再握上布偶，整個人就精神為之抖擻，甚至還能來一段熟悉的口白，「英雄代代出，好像是滿色天星，閃閃熾熾…」，無愧是國寶級的掌中戲泰斗。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154931-5ffpvg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154931-5ffpvg8","updated":"20240521154931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每天照顧阿公的黃國賢說，長年四處奔波演出，讓阿公培養出堅毅不拔的個性，相當獨立，凡事都自己來，不喜歡人家服侍；阿公在一百零三歲中風那一年，還常常忘了自己中風，突然從輪椅站起來要拿東西或和人說話，或許就因有這樣忘我的心境，才讓阿公忘了自己已是百歲之年。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154931-buge06n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154931-buge06n","updated":"20240521154931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"與黃海岱相交三十多年的文建會主委邱坤良說，黃海岱已沒有早年縱橫南北兩路時的霸氣，反倒像一尊活菩薩終日笑迷迷。他邱坤良曾問黃海岱長壽康健的「撇步」？黃海岱一句「會喘氣（呼吸）就好了」，道盡晚年的黃海岱繁花看盡，一切已無所求，這是超過一世紀的歷練，才體悟出的人生哲理。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154931-wkuaf9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154931-wkuaf9c","updated":"20240521154931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【2007/02/11 聯合報】"}]},{"ID":"20240521154931-zaa7dxz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154931-zaa7dxz","updated":"20240521154931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240517103448-2dk2go9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240521154931-xogci2h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154931-xogci2h","updated":"20240521154931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154931-6lrbllj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154931-6lrbllj","updated":"20240521154931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這人活得比西醫師壽命長兩倍以上，這就表示他是對的，短命的西醫是錯誤的，誰比西醫來得長壽誰就是對的，無需狡辯事實證明了ㄧ切，我不要大家去體檢最主要原因就是體檢以後你就不開心了，每天爲ㄧ個數字活著，人生許多美好的事從此就消失殆盡，人生就乏味，然後就是死於疾病了，大家只要相信自己就沒事，相信西醫就是惡夢的開始，自此以後就永無安寧日子了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154931-zxyfhjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154931-zxyfhjm","updated":"20240521154931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"結論是 : "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這才是衛生署應該推薦的案例。 但是他們不會做的，因為沒錢賺了。 如何證明呢? 很簡單就可以證明，證據是三十年前榮總胸腔內科主任叫做虞光舜，當年他一直呼籲說抽煙會得肺癌，所以自此以後整個榮總就禁煙了，結果這位一生不抽煙的肺癌專家就在54歲時，因為得到肺癌而死去，死亡時的年紀足足比上面這位一直抽煙的老先生少掉一半，西醫真是爛阿，上面這張照片就是活生生的證據，有哪個笨蛋反對阿。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154935-ijhwhjk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154935-ijhwhjk"}},{"ID":"20240521154941-3jj5j28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154941-3jj5j28","updated":"20240521154943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"美國壽命計算網站幫你「算命」　想長壽生活習慣最重要"}]},{"ID":"20240521154941-zbiq2o1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154941-zbiq2o1","updated":"20240521154941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2007/04/12 11:50 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"記者:記者何世皇／編譯"}]},{"ID":"20240521154941-dicyslg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154941-dicyslg","updated":"20240521154941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"想知道自己能活多久嗎？美國科學家最近研究出壽命計算方程式，可以從你的生活習慣，知道你的壽命有多長，專家還建議民眾，什麼樣的壞習慣，一定要改掉，才能活得比較久。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154941-1jnqswp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154941-1jnqswp","updated":"20240521154941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很多人都想知道自己能活到一百歲，還是提早進墳墓，美國醫學專家培爾提出壽命計算方程式，讓你知道自己還能活多久。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154941-wwww39f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154941-wwww39f","updated":"20240521154941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今年37歲的CNN醫學專家谷普塔，本身就是神經外科醫生，還兼差擔任CNN的醫學新聞記者，一天工作18個小時以上，當然一天睡不到8個小時。專家警告，如果長期睡眠不到8小時，可能會讓你失去一年半的壽命。此外，每天喝掉兩杯以上的咖啡，壽命又會少掉一年以上。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154941-w7lyijc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154941-w7lyijc","updated":"20240521154941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"專家建議，每周工作時間應該少於40個小時，增加運動及家庭相聚時間，最重要的是，建立良好的生活習慣，才能益壽延年。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154941-1kncl7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154941-1kncl7v","updated":"20240521154941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"美國科學雜誌編輯約翰雷尼說，「整體而言，基因好，但是生活習慣不好的人，壽命可能大大少於基因不是那麼好，但是生活習慣很好的人。」"}]},{"ID":"20240521154941-gx152ym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154941-gx152ym","updated":"20240521154941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"維他命不能亂吃，因為部分民眾可能出現過敏反應﹔減少食物攝取量，雖然能夠延年益壽，卻沒有必要一直挨餓降低生活品質。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154941-9hkhybl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154941-9hkhybl","updated":"20240521154941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根據壽命計算公式，美國CNN的女主播能活到89歲，男主播則有78歲的壽命，想知道你還有多久可以活嗎？不妨自己算算看吧。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154945-na12rfu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154945-na12rfu"}},{"ID":"20240521154951-6rsheox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154951-6rsheox","updated":"20240521154951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"新疆喀什:保持樂觀是長生不老藥"}]},{"ID":"20240521154951-wryiu3a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154951-wryiu3a","updated":"20240521154951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2008/10/09 14:35"}]},{"ID":"20240521154951-tctfqib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154951-tctfqib","updated":"20240521154951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"新疆是國際醫學界公認的世界五大長壽地區之一，喀什則更有(長壽之鄉)的美譽。目前，擁有370多萬人口的喀什地區百歲老人已達604人，而在近日被選為(中國壽星)的維吾爾族人(薩迪克·薩伍提)就是來自這裏。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154951-smvhnqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154951-smvhnqp","updated":"20240521154951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"據喀什地區老齡委辦公室主任(伍偉忠)指出，百歲老人中以少數民族居多，男女比例相當，他們當中大部分來自農村，長期從事體力勞動，其中一些人生活仍可以自理。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這裡沒有西藥汙染，疫苗汙染，勞動又多，空氣又好。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154951-hnvzl9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154951-hnvzl9f","updated":"20240521154951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"百歲老人長壽經自然是眾人關注的話題。伍偉忠說，喀什百歲老人在生活中有許多共性。首先，保持樂觀是(長生不老)的關鍵因素，他們大多都心態平和，順其自然；其次，他們的生活很規律，並熱愛勞動；再次，他們居住的環境大多在農村，遠離喧囂。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(真是天然生活，好福氣的地方。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154951-ywd6lup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154951-ywd6lup","updated":"20240521154951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"維吾爾族人一直以來喜好食用牛羊肉，然而喀什百歲老人們大多控制吃肉量，他們愛吃新鮮水果、乾果，同時喜好喝茶。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(茶絕對比咖啡好，讀者看到了嗎?)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154951-7v990uk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154951-7v990uk","updated":"20240521154951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伍偉忠說，隨著近年來醫療及人民生活水準的不斷提高，喀什的百歲老人還將逐年增加。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154951-44a0qot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154951-44a0qot","updated":"20240521154951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"這就是真正的證據"}]},{"ID":"20240521154951-hhoieiq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154951-hhoieiq","updated":"20240521154951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自古以來，我國有無數的長壽記錄，這些紀錄都出現在五代同堂的族譜中，只是大家都沒有注意到，幾乎所有能夠長壽的人瑞，都有一個共同的特點，就是一直有開心愉快的心情在，越是含飴弄孫多，越就長壽，再加上過去是沒有西藥與疫苗的世界，所以大家都很健康，食物又沒有農藥的汙染，也沒有改良過的食物，處在這種天然絕佳的環境之下當然會開心又長壽，所以這篇報導直接證明了西藥廠就是害人生病，害人不開心，害人短命的原兇了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154951-0awetje","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154951-0awetje"}},{"ID":"20240521154957-p7mqewv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154957-p7mqewv","updated":"20240521154958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"英國男子打賭能活一百歲　真贏了"}]},{"ID":"20240521154957-tayeeta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154957-tayeeta","updated":"20240521154957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2007/04/25 03:00"}]},{"ID":"20240521154957-dwuxh24","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154957-dwuxh24","updated":"20240521154957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名英國男子十年前打賭，說他能活到1百歲，這星期他果然活到1百歲，於是向簽賭站領取兩萬5千英鎊，相當160萬新台幣。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154957-g18nt16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154957-g18nt16","updated":"20240521154957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1997年〔霍登〕先生已經90歲，他問簽賭站，敢不敢以他是否能活到百歲打賭，簽賭站同意打賭，但認為〔霍登〕活不到百歲跟活到百歲的機會，是250比1。〔霍登〕拿出的賭注是1百英鎊，相當於6千4百元新台幣，對方下注兩萬5千英鎊。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154957-a5f6hli","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154957-a5f6hli","updated":"20240521154957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這個星期一，〔霍登〕真的度過他一百歲的生日。他打電話給簽賭站，說他已經活到1百歲，對方得付款了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154957-5tmnazv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154957-5tmnazv","updated":"20240521154957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔霍登〕拿到這兩萬五千英鎊，相當於一百六十萬新台幣。他說他的長壽秘訣是多喝粥，多下棋，多呼吸。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154957-lkttvd4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154957-lkttvd4","updated":"20240521154957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521154957-77r2lom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521154957-77r2lom","updated":"20240521154957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    讀者看最後ㄧ段說的長壽原因，直到目前為止，世界上所有長壽的人瑞，沒有ㄧ位是因為吃西藥與維他命而獲得長壽的，都是吃天然食品與保持心情開朗，多運動而長壽的。"}]},{"ID":"20240521154957-ifoixec","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521154957-ifoixec"}},{"ID":"20240521155006-dbixdqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155006-dbixdqe","updated":"20240521155008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"灌紅酒、菸槍多 法國人瑞卻超多"}]},{"ID":"20240521155006-ye138pj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155006-ye138pj","updated":"20240521155006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2008/04/06 07:30 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"編譯夏嘉玲綜合報導"}]},{"ID":"20240521155006-8yv47g8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155006-8yv47g8","updated":"20240521155006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  法國百齡人瑞近年來如爆炸般成長，不到20年間暴增4倍多。專家推測，法國人之所以能長命「百歲」，除了法國氣候宜人、法國菜有益健康外，先進的醫療也功不可沒。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這裡說錯了，法國人因為太了解西藥的禍害，從不喜歡吃西藥，所以才會長壽啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155006-37ru7jr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155006-37ru7jr","updated":"20240521155006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  英國獨立報報導，法國1990年有3760位人瑞，今年則增至20115人，18年間增加逾4倍。依此速率推算，到本世紀中葉，法國人瑞可能突破17萬人，這種增幅連人瑞成長速度高居各年齡層人口之冠的英國也望塵莫及。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(其長壽的真正原因是法國人除了不喜歡吃西藥外，天生浪漫的個性是主要原因。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155006-6hpamya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155006-6hpamya","updated":"20240521155006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  法國人瑞男女比例懸殊，女性占了七成五左右。1997年辭世的法國老祖母珍妮．卡爾芒 (Jeanne Calment)至今仍是全球最高齡紀錄保持人，她活了122年5個月又14天。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155006-f43c6ia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155006-f43c6ia","updated":"20240521155006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  約10年前，美國研究人員就發現與法國人長壽有關的所謂「法國矛盾」現象，一是法國人喝大量紅酒，菸槍也多，照理說會傷身，卻人瑞輩出。二是法國人好爭辯抱怨，心懷不滿，有違一般知足常樂能延年益壽的說法。三則是法國人飲食習慣逐漸改變。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這些研究人員是在閉門造車啊，居然不知道法國連總統都可以隨便離婚，然後立刻再婚，娶一位露過三點的女名模，這種事如果出現在台灣或是其他國家，請問該國人民可以接受嗎?只有法國人民可以接受的，從此可以看出法國人有多浪漫。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155006-azmsf41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155006-azmsf41","updated":"20240521155006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  與英國人相較，75歲以下法國人的心臟病死亡率不及前者一半，婦女癌症罹患率也較低。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這就表示法國人比英國人浪漫，英國人太拘謹了，太守成規太紳士了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155006-1k04ka0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155006-1k04ka0","updated":"20240521155006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  法國研究人員對本國人瑞增加特別快也十分納悶，有人推測是法國氣候、飲食有養生功效所致，然而這兩項因素多年來大致一樣，於是有人歸因為1940年代以來醫療水準長足進步的功勞。美國研究人員則認為，法國人什麼都吃，較不偏食，但吃得不多，可能是長壽的原因。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這些人都在胡亂猜測，沒有一個是對的。真是笨啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155006-05o7yx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155006-05o7yx5","updated":"20240521155006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155006-vwdm0ez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155006-vwdm0ez","updated":"20240521155006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    如果說是因為法國的醫療水準長足進步才造成人民長壽的話，請問美國跟英國還有台灣的醫療水準會比法國差嗎? 如果比法國好，為何法國人比這些所謂醫療水準高的國家來得長壽呢? 所以這原因是錯誤的，一定是西藥廠說的謊話。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155006-qxlyw2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155006-qxlyw2v","updated":"20240521155006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    全篇報導沒有提到的就是法國人非常講究浪漫氣息，非常注重氣氛的感受，每位法國男人都自認為自己是情聖，愉悅的心情，加上對自己的自信心，更非常了解西藥的害處，法國人不喜歡吃西藥與維他命是有名的， 還有就是法人非常注重美食，對於美國的速食文化是斥之以鼻，這些才是他們真正能夠長壽的原因所在。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155006-6s9e0y5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155006-6s9e0y5","updated":"20240521155006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"台灣人將會越來越短命的，因為台灣人亂吃西藥，亂打各種不必要的疫苗，亂吃根本不必要的維他命等，然後不安定的政治環境讓人憂鬱，於是心情不好再加上西藥的荼毒，理所當然會短命啊。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155009-o61uh63","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155009-o61uh63"}},{"ID":"20240521155015-nw5lz4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155015-nw5lz4v","updated":"20240521155015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"世界頭號壽星115歲去世 只去過1次醫院"}]},{"ID":"20240521155015-k85kzl7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155015-k85kzl7","updated":"20240521155015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2009/01/04 08:05"}]},{"ID":"20240521155015-qfzndj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155015-qfzndj5","updated":"20240521155015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   據英國(太陽報)報導，世界頭號壽星、葡萄牙老人(傑蘇斯)1月2號在葡萄牙西北部城市(托馬爾)去世，享年115歲114天，金氏世界紀錄將她列為世界最長壽老人。當天，托馬爾市議會證實了傑蘇斯的死訊。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155015-wccn8jl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155015-wccn8jl","updated":"20240521155015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   據了解，傑蘇斯生於1893年9月10號，據說她從不喝酒、抽煙、喝咖啡，愛吃魚和蔬菜。57歲喪夫後她一人生活至今，生了6個兒女，其中3人先她去世。傑蘇斯有11個孫子、16個曾孫和5個玄孫。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(良好的飲食習慣，也是她能長壽健康的原因之一)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155015-ub4dhia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155015-ub4dhia","updated":"20240521155015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   傑蘇斯的家人說，她當天早餐時突然感到身體不適，在被送往醫院的救護車上去世，而在此前，她僅去過一次醫院。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(一生只去過醫院一次，這就是她會長壽的真正原因所在。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155015-dud07py","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155015-dud07py","updated":"20240521155015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"長壽的原因"}]},{"ID":"20240521155015-njww0yh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155015-njww0yh","updated":"20240521155015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   這個真實案例已經跟世人證明了一點，就是常去醫院的人都會短命，我只建議我的敵人，每年都去做體檢，這樣才會讓我的敵人生病，生活才會失去興趣，花費許多錢去多吃些西藥與維他命，這樣他們的病才會更重，於是就中年夭折於癌症，讓西醫將我的敵人殺死，這是最合法的殺人手法，請大家多多利用這一個管道，將你的敵人消滅，你自己千萬不要去醫院，於是你就存活下來而且更開心，因為你的敵人都被西醫活生生的做掉了，這種除去你心頭之患的方式實在是太好的方法了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155015-8n6xrrl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155015-8n6xrrl","updated":"20240521155015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   我可以很肯定的告訴大家，如果讓驗屍官去解剖檢查她的屍體，必然可以發現依照現代的西醫學說，她必然患有各種的癌症，如肝癌，肺癌，大腸癌，胰臟癌等，但是她卻不是因為這些癌症而死的，是因為太老而死亡的，癌症不可怕，可怕的是去動它，將這潘朵拉的盒子打開後，你生存的機會就不會很多，她一生只去過一次醫院，所以根本不知道她自己的身體狀況如何? 而這就是她開心又長壽的來源了，每年都去做體檢的人是最不開心的，也是最短命的一群。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155016-p6x1zcv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155016-p6x1zcv"}},{"ID":"20240521155022-dotw0a0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155022-dotw0a0","updated":"20240521155027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"老生長談 生活五得 長壽秘訣"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n【中時電子報 】\n羅赫（花蓮讀者）人要活得老，必須育五得！"}]},{"ID":"20240521155022-t60t3f6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155022-t60t3f6","updated":"20240521155022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一、忘得：凡事莫掛在心頭。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155022-gxmww28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155022-gxmww28","updated":"20240521155022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不要與任何人計較；不要與任何事計較（切勿計得失）；勇於施捨；爽於助人；自然活得快樂！"}]},{"ID":"20240521155022-wf1pkh4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155022-wf1pkh4","updated":"20240521155022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二、空得：心理內在，隨時保持空虛靈潔，光明磊落。不要讓任何事，記罣心頭；也不要讓任何事，佔據心頭。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155022-bak6ns5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155022-bak6ns5","updated":"20240521155022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三、吃得：老年人，仍有老年人的食慾。健康者多半食慾佳；反之，則食慾差。昔秦欲攻趙，趙王為了抗秦，欲召廉頗老將軍為帥。在掛帥之前，特先命使者前去觀察，看他的飯量是否尚佳？"}]},{"ID":"20240521155022-uko4di6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155022-uko4di6","updated":"20240521155022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第四、睡得：「欲要活得老，睡眠保持好。」不管年紀多大，一定每天要有充足暢甜的睡眠。當然，不一定要有年輕人那樣的長；但長短、甜度，一定要與其年齡相當。陳立夫先生，活到一百餘歲，他在百歲自述中說：「他每天上床即入睡，一覺到天亮。」"}]},{"ID":"20240521155022-ew049ah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155022-ew049ah","updated":"20240521155022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第五、動得：活動、活動。要想活得好、活得老，就要充分動。不管是系統性的，早晚按時作健身操；或勤務性農工等生活，每天一定要有充分的運動。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155022-zj0nn5x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155022-zj0nn5x","updated":"20240521155022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"八九高齡的美國第一位電視健身大師拉蘭：每天清晨五時起床，舉重、游泳兩小時，伏地挺身對他來說也是小意思。他說：「老年人別整天坐在搖椅上，應該為生命『動起來』。」"}]},{"ID":"20240521155022-6gb0jyh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155022-6gb0jyh","updated":"20240521155022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"假如要想食慾與睡眠好，每天一定要「動」。所以，「動得」，又是「吃得」與「睡得」之保母！"}]},{"ID":"20240521155022-0mqtr9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155022-0mqtr9r","updated":"20240521155022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155022-hdlj2c4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155022-hdlj2c4","updated":"20240521155022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    我的徒弟真好 , 一直勸我不要生氣 , 看來如此才會長壽的 , 被一些爛西藥跟一些少數庸醫生氣真是划不來 , 我一直是個開心寶寶 , 這篇報導太好了 ,"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 從頭到尾沒有說要多吃西藥 , 這就是長壽的秘訣了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" . 我要多學習學習 , 有一天當我的學生能夠取代我 , 為人類謀取真正的無憂無慮的健康生活時 , 我保證我每天都帶著微笑去睡覺 . 大家加油 ."}]},{"ID":"20240521155022-ys9ncbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155022-ys9ncbm","updated":"20240521155022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":" 結論是 :"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 每天吃西藥的人要注意了 , 從這篇報導中我們就可以証明吃西藥是絕對短命的 , 就算不短命也會去自殺 , 然後死掉 , 永遠不要相信西藥廠公佈的死亡率, 騙人的 ."}]},{"ID":"20240521155022-2pbslq0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155022-2pbslq0"}},{"ID":"20240521155034-iwvhn1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155034-iwvhn1u","updated":"20240521155037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中醫養生 早養生 活百歲 孫思邈長壽之道"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n【中時電子報 】\n林昭庚（中國醫藥大學中國醫學研究所教授）對於養生，中國人可說是世界上最懂得保健的民族，早在二千多年前，中醫就有許多與養生相關的文獻論述，其中最具代表的養生保健實踐家就是享年一百零一歲的孫思邈。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這位孫思邈就是我最尊崇的醫師)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n因體弱多病苦習醫術 成一代大師"}]},{"ID":"20240521155034-4yqw47j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155034-4yqw47j","updated":"20240521155034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因年輕時期體弱多病，而刻苦研習山支黃之術的孫思邈，具有廣博的藥物學知識基礎，對攝生、食療、針灸、預防等方面均有極深的研究，他至百歲仍能視聽不衰，更成為唐代名極一時的醫學大師。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這可以說明一件事,我國唐朝時期根本沒有維他命跟抗生素及疫苗等,我們就可以活如此長,所以現在的西醫學是錯誤的,它們讓我們更痛苦更短命.)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155034-etz0cws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155034-etz0cws","updated":"20240521155034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其著作《備急千金藥方》、《千金翼方》等書，便集結了前代醫、道、儒家與古印度佛家的養生思想，認為「養性」與「養老」乃延年之本，其中包含的範圍涉及到預防醫學、心身醫學、老年醫學，甚至優生醫學與飲食療法。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155034-r9gmu2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155034-r9gmu2x","updated":"20240521155034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"調攝情志、節慾固精 養性之法"}]},{"ID":"20240521155034-0nck9vi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155034-0nck9vi","updated":"20240521155034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"關於養性之道，孫思邈認為應做到調攝情志，節慾固精，在情志上保持樂觀，房事與飲食均需有節制；「食養、食治與藥療」維持良好的精神狀態和飲食習慣，以防損傷脾胃，妨礙氣血而致病，並強調食療與藥療法對疾病的治療和預防作用；「運動健身與調氣攝養」他認為人們可施行適當運動及氣功，如按摩健身法、調氣法、內視法等，藉由吐故納新、動靜結合，達到健身目的。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155034-6mvixqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155034-6mvixqd","updated":"20240521155034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶冶性情、生活有常 養老之道"}]},{"ID":"20240521155034-q0wbo9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155034-q0wbo9m","updated":"20240521155034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而「養老之道」則是指老年人的養生，即現代通稱的「老年醫學」，孫思邈認為五十歲以上的人即為老年人，此時期可能因生理上之衰老而引起許多精神病變與多病的老化現象，因此其主張養老之要應當陶冶性情、要生活有常、須飲食有節、行調身按摩，即是指老年時期的養生應保持愉快的心情、規律的生活、適當的飲食及適度的運動。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155034-xgn328i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155034-xgn328i","updated":"20240521155034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其實在傳統醫學觀點，認為人的正氣可維持身體正常的生理功能，並有抵禦外邪，如細菌、病毒等一些致病因子的能力，一般來說，疾病的形成是因為身體內部的功能失調，加上外來致病源入侵所引起，只要能補充足夠的營養，維持身體機能運作，增加抵抗力，就不容易感染疾病。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155034-t974cm1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155034-t974cm1","updated":"20240521155034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不吃藥能治病 養生上策"}]},{"ID":"20240521155034-su1uqqt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155034-su1uqqt","updated":"20240521155034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所謂「養生」便頗有「上工治未病」的道理，即在病未發之前事先利用各種方法來調和體質，使身體強健免於疾病的侵犯，甚至預防其發生，若能達到「不吃藥而能治病」才是養生上策。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155034-yvtvwn6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155034-yvtvwn6","updated":"20240521155034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孫思邈的養性與養老觀點，不僅是他能年壽百餘歲的成功訣竅，也豐富了中國養生長壽的理論，最後，我們必須強調一點，養生不是中老年人的專利，人生每一階段都有不同的保養重點，而及早開始注意健康，才是最有效的養生之道。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155034-z5ololl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155034-z5ololl","updated":"20240521155034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155034-uez8apx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155034-uez8apx","updated":"20240521155034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    這個例子可以十足的証明現代西醫學是錯誤的,只有中醫是對的,民眾應該多學習這位古代中醫的學術與醫術,接近中藥,遠離西藥,我再舉一例來說明中醫有多好,我們如果去參觀古代屍體,無論是埃及人的或是中國古代帝王的,這些"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"上千年以上的古屍"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":",他們的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"骨骼都還完好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":",反觀"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"現代的人,居然有許多還是活著的人,骨頭就已經出現疏鬆,流失鈣質"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":",你們想想看有多可怕多可憐了,現代人之所以會不如古人,就是因為太迷信西醫學了,太相信西藥,太相信維他命了,所以才有今天的結果出現,"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我國唐朝時期有西醫學嗎?"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此我希望大家生活盡量自然,不要想不開,多接觸中醫藥,多多向古人學習,如果這樣,你當然可以像這位孫思邈一樣,活得快樂高興又長壽健康了."}]},{"ID":"20240521155034-eq4grn1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155034-eq4grn1"}},{"ID":"20240521155046-gxnzrg6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155046-gxnzrg6","updated":"20240521155046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"復活島神奇土壤 抗衰老青春之「藥」"}]},{"ID":"20240521155046-e8s3w69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155046-e8s3w69","updated":"20240521155046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2009/07/10 04:09"}]},{"ID":"20240521155046-6inq5gp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155046-6inq5gp","updated":"20240521155046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔編譯陳成良／綜合報導〕美國科學家六日發表的最新研究報告指出，提取自南太平洋復活島土壤中微生物、原用來避免器官移植病患產生排斥反應的一種抗生素，竟能讓老鼠壽命延長最多達二十八％，相當於活到人類一百多歲。這項研究是目前判定某種藥物可延長哺乳類壽命的首例，或有助醫學界開發抗老化藥物，讓科幻小說中延年益壽的情節變得不再虛幻。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155046-2cb7sm6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155046-2cb7sm6","updated":"20240521155046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"老藥新用 抗排斥藥「斥消靈」意外新功效"}]},{"ID":"20240521155046-t9szx7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155046-t9szx7n","updated":"20240521155046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這種從復活島土壤採集的樣本中發現的細菌副產品名為「雷帕黴素」（Rapamycin），又稱「西羅莫斯」（Sirolimus），惠氏藥廠以「斥消靈」（Rapamune）商標在市場上販售。Rapamycin原本處方予器官移植病人使用，有抑制免疫系統作用，同時也可抗發炎，而發炎正是部分癌症、心臟病、阿茲海默氏症等疾病背後成因。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155046-1786d9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155046-1786d9q","updated":"20240521155046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在這篇刊登於「自然」期刊的研究報告中，緬因州傑克森實驗室研究人員哈里遜領導的研究團隊寫道：「Rapamycin可望延長壽命，不論是以延緩癌症死亡或阻滯老化，或兩者同時並進。」"}]},{"ID":"20240521155046-7gjjcdd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155046-7gjjcdd","updated":"20240521155046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"老鼠延壽28％ 相當人類百歲"}]},{"ID":"20240521155046-bmqk7y9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155046-bmqk7y9","updated":"20240521155046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"由於Rapamycin能抑制無脊椎動物老化酵素生成，研究人員決定將其加入二十個月大（相當於人類六十歲）的老鼠飼料中，結果發現Rapamycin延長成年母鼠壽命平均達十三％、雄鼠達九％，有些老鼠甚至延長五十五％。最令人稱奇的是，在最長壽十％老鼠中，母鼠多活三十八％，公鼠多活二十八％。而且，即使實驗中的老鼠已步入中老年，這種藥物仍然有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155046-y40zxab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155046-y40zxab","updated":"20240521155046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以老鼠為樣本所做的老化過程研究，此前科學家認為只有兩種機制可延長哺乳類動物的壽命，即控制飲食和基因修補，但這兩種機制均難以應用於人體。Rapamycin可能會讓人體認為卡路里的攝入有所減少，從而達到延長壽命的效果。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(意思就是不要暴飲暴食，才是長壽之道。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155046-ik4w3e3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155046-ik4w3e3","updated":"20240521155046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不過，科學家也警告，大家不應期待能藉由服用Rapamycin來延長壽命，因為這種強力抗排斥藥物對健康人士帶來的危險，遠大於潛在益處，但Rapamycin的效用或可凸顯老化過程中的生物歷程，從而有助開發出更安全的抗老化藥物。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155046-adfope4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155046-adfope4","updated":"20240521155046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155046-uahcuix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155046-uahcuix","updated":"20240521155046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  其實我已經找到真正可以讓人長壽的飲食方法，只是我不能公佈在網頁上，第一 : 必然造成物價水漲船高的結果。第二 : 讓西藥廠拿去，做成自己的研發成果，於是又開始賺取黑心錢。第三 : 讓壞人延年益壽是危害人間的，所以不能告訴大家。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155046-5qboe0b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155046-5qboe0b","updated":"20240521155046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   就算你們不知道也還是可以長壽健康，其重要訣竅就是少量多餐，多運動多吸新鮮空氣，居住在山去的人多喝自然界的水，城市中的人多喝煮開的自來水，這樣就已經足夠了，不要聽信電視廣告中的說詞，也不要相信衛生署說的話，多聽聽消積會的建議，這樣至少就不會出錯。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155046-6ou2047","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155046-6ou2047","updated":"20240521155046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2009年07月10日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155047-26nua6s","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155047-26nua6s"}},{"ID":"20240521155056-d14m658","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155056-d14m658","updated":"20240521155056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"勤走路變健康 既省錢傷害又少"}]},{"ID":"20240521155056-wk6sukp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155056-wk6sukp","updated":"20240521155056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2008/10/17 22:15"}]},{"ID":"20240521155056-y1koyrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155056-y1koyrs","updated":"20240521155056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"住在南投的孫正春，和太太每天都要這樣赤腳走路，一走就走上六個小時，而且已經連續走了十七年。對他來說，走路讓很會生病的他變健康，甚至更救了他的命，十七年前，他的脖子發現腫瘤、確定是癌症，但他沒有開刀、也沒有吃藥，靠走路病竟然就好了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(走路是最好的運動，這是正確的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155056-jsslxta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155056-jsslxta","updated":"20240521155056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"簡單的走路，就可以換來健康，也因此長期推動健走運動的希望基金會，呼籲民眾多走路，就是是挖健康的金，因為走路不像騎腳踏車、還要花錢買車，也不像跑步很激烈，會傷到膝蓋，1992年，WHO還說走路是最完美的運動。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155056-49rykbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155056-49rykbi","updated":"20240521155056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紀政強調，正確的健走，要抬頭挺胸，把肚子縮進去，兩隻手自然擺動，走到有一點喘、有一點流汗就有效，最好每天都走，就可以換來健康的身體。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155056-itt3yzu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155056-itt3yzu","updated":"20240521155056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"記者林靜梅陳柏諭台北報導。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155056-l18ks5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155056-l18ks5g","updated":"20240521155056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"腎經在腿上"}]},{"ID":"20240521155056-dwl30z7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155056-dwl30z7","updated":"20240521155056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   中醫學中認為足少陰腎經跟足太陽膀胱經，都在腿上，走路時就要靠這二條主要的經脈在運作，多走路就等於是在訓練加強腎臟的功能，而腎臟主管骨頭，主管記憶，又主頭髮，主聽力，一旦老化，自然人就跟著衰老，所以要健康長壽又年輕，多走路是絕對有幫助的。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155057-z344vl2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155057-z344vl2"}},{"ID":"20240521155103-43shvma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-43shvma","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"老婦山區迷途 內褲袪鬼脫困"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-6eusdvi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-6eusdvi","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2008/07/23 04:33 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"林和生屏東報導"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-hzxmx2h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-hzxmx2h","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"颱風過後上山採菇失蹤五天的八十三歲老婦洪林對仔，廿二日上午出現在距離失蹤地不到二公里的恆春社頂公園，除了身上衣服破爛、稍微虛脫外，全身毫髮無傷。她描述這五天是被紅衣紅髮的鬼魅拖著走，最後把內褲脫給對方，自己才脫困，光怪陸離的說法，令人匪夷所思。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-9wmji9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-9wmji9c","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洪林對仔是十八日在卡玫基"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a","TextMarkAHref":"https://www.hantang.com/chinese/ch_Articles/stroke8.htm?","TextMarkATitle":"颱風","TextMarkTextContent":"颱風"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"過後，到恆春社頂公園山區採集雞肉絲菇，原本同行的有四、五個人，但疑似為了躲雨，而與其他同伴走散。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-v9pd6o6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-v9pd6o6","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上山採菇 失蹤五天毫髮無傷"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-93fowoi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-93fowoi","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"當地軍警義消出動上百人搜山找尋，毫無所獲，沒想到廿二日上午，老婦竟然自己出現在社頂公園的梅花鹿復育區，雖然全身衣服破爛，但卻毫髮無傷，在旁人的輔助下緊急送往恆春署立醫院觀察治療。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-ft6mk1s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-ft6mk1s","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"搭載老婦就醫的山區巡守員張中澤表示，早上有群學生到社頂公園校外教學，是孩子們先發現洪林對仔，還給她喝豆漿解飢，雖然看起來非常狼狽，但精神狀況還算良好。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-5yx2vx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-5yx2vx8","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五天在山區與外界隔絕的日子，大家都想知道老婦如何求生。但據她表示，是因為遇到一個紅頭髮的鬼魅，身高異常高大，看起來非常恐怖，且紅髮鬼在這幾天都一直跟著她，並一直要搶她身上的衣物，就這樣持續了五天。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-uogkyx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-uogkyx5","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鬼魅拖著走 吃月桃葉心止飢"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-o394awz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-o394awz","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洪林對仔稍後更激動地說，自己原本走得又酸又痛的雙腿，被紅髮鬼連拖帶拉後，腳竟然不酸也不痛；更神奇的是，原本略跛的右腳，竟也意外不跛了，雖然自己迷迷糊糊，但可能走了將近二十公里。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這段就是我要說的重點了)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-a6q4i18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-a6q4i18","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洪婦說，紅髮鬼每天早上五點就叫她起床，天黑就請她休息，也教她吃月桃葉的心止飢，就這樣過了五天，直到早上她將自己的內褲脫給紅髮鬼後，鬼才願意離開，而她也突然看到眼前的遊客，才立刻求救。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-h8pwkw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-h8pwkw4","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"員警：她神智恍忽產生幻覺"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-kmauq2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-kmauq2o","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但警方對此說法無法採信，承辦多起山區失蹤意外的員警表示，應該是老婦人走進太深的山裡迷失方向，加上多日來沒有正常進食，造成神智恍忽，才會產生幻覺而有此光怪陸離的說法，也很可能就在山區附近繞來繞去，並未走遠。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-jkvxqle","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-jkvxqle","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"參與搜救人員表示，當時大家認為老婦人年紀大，不太可能往北邊的原始林前進，因此都將人力部署在南邊靠近船帆石的山區，才未及時找到人。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-wzui8aw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-wzui8aw","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"老婦人因身體有點虛脫，家人上午已送她到醫院治療，對於她神奇的遭遇，家人平靜地說，不管遇到什麼都無所謂，平安回來最重要，其他的不想多說。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-crqqst3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-crqqst3","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中風的正確復健法"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-glnnw93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-glnnw93","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"最正確的醫學概念是來自日常生活上的一些Common Sense"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，上段中我說的紅色部份就是重點，我每次使用針灸與中藥治療中風半身癱瘓的病人時，我就會跟病人說，你因為很長一段時間無法正常走路，所以已經忘記如何走路了，這個時候你應該要逼自己跑步，這樣才會完全恢復過來，因為世上沒有一個人一直在跑，每個人的一生走路絕對多於跑步，所以大家 對於走路都習以為常，因此當你出現無法正常走路時，你就要去跑，因為你不常使用跑，許多病患聽我的陳述以後，都認為非常有道理，於是開始強力的逼自己去跑，結果病患恢復的速度都非常的驚人，讀者說呢?"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-yqk9rtc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-yqk9rtc","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   至於此婦人看到什麼鬼，我沒有意見也沒有評論。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-1yomvjx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-1yomvjx","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"人是活的，活著就要動，就是活動，活著不動，就是死亡的降臨，西醫面臨重病患時，都是讓病人住在病床上，所以自然就死了，我卻正好相反，我帶病人去郊遊去採水果，這就是Common Sense。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-cmnmrvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-cmnmrvw","updated":"20240521155103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫  倪海廈謹記07/23/2008"}]},{"ID":"20240521155103-p8rh0we","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155103-p8rh0we"}},{"ID":"20240521155114-3hmbiuz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155114-3hmbiuz","updated":"20240521155114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡跨3個世紀老人逝世 多幹活是長壽秘訣"}]},{"ID":"20240521155114-hojxh9g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155114-hojxh9g","updated":"20240521155114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2009/04/12 09:35"}]},{"ID":"20240521155114-j345ygm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155114-j345ygm","updated":"20240521155114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"據挪威媒體報導，挪威一名年齡跨越三個世紀的老壽星11號與世長辭，享年109歲。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155114-dhpvz78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155114-dhpvz78","updated":"20240521155114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這位老壽星名叫(珍妮)，出生於1899年4月30號。1905年挪威以公民表決的方式，宣佈脫離瑞典時，她已是6歲的小女孩。1945年第二次世界大戰結束時，她已進入中年。2008年12月，她成為挪威最長壽的老者。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(當年並沒有像現在這麼多的疫苗與抗生素與各種西藥存在，所以她能健康。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155114-s8ate0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155114-s8ate0z","updated":"20240521155114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"兩年前，珍妮在回答有關提問時說，健康又營養的食品和多幹活是她長壽的秘訣，沒有人因為多幹活而受到傷害。("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"這裡她說的健康有營養的食品，沒有經過加工過的就是天然食物，這跟現在直銷公司賣的所謂健康食品完全不同，讀者千萬不可以被直銷公司騙去購買他們的健康食品，這些經過加工過後的，已經不是食品了，吃多了不但不健康，反而傷身體。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155114-lbr0e2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155114-lbr0e2t","updated":"20240521155114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"挪威是目前世界上人均壽命最長的國家之一，2008年人均壽命80.63歲，其中女性平均壽命82.95歲，男性78.31歲。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155114-580icnc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155114-580icnc","updated":"20240521155114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155114-ocvr5ov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155114-ocvr5ov","updated":"20240521155114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    長壽的秘訣就是多動，吃越天然的食物越好，喝水時可以加一片檸檬片在水中，增加鹼性，有生病時就找中醫治療，感冒就吃中藥，遠離各種不必要的疫苗，永遠不要去吃各種維他命與鈣片，遠離市面上一點都不健康的健康食品，保持心開朗，要去除物質欲望，眼高手低是最痛苦的人，每逢週末就安排出遊，或是參加各種活動，這就是現代人的長壽之道也。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155114-8tvwiti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155114-8tvwiti","updated":"20240521155114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於佛州2009年04月13日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155114-bve4cw4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155114-bve4cw4"}},{"ID":"20240521155125-l7ftj97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155125-l7ftj97","updated":"20240521155125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"西藏最長壽老人度118歲生日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155125-37r2rmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155125-37r2rmz","updated":"20240521155125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2009/03/17 15:05"}]},{"ID":"20240521155125-22avo9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155125-22avo9c","updated":"20240521155125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大陸西藏林周縣江夏鄉加榮村藏族老人(阿麥次仁)昨天歡度118歲生日，她是西藏年齡最大的老人。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155125-vskhejn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155125-vskhejn","updated":"20240521155125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"新華社報導，(阿麥次仁)坐在拉薩住家院子裡的沙發上，左手捻著一串黃色的佛珠，安靜地曬著太陽。在她的身旁站著一群手提禮物，前來為她慶賀生日的鄰里鄉親和縣里幹部。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155125-ocoaulm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155125-ocoaulm","updated":"20240521155125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這位西藏最長壽的老人已經走過了三個世紀。當地政府核發的戶口名簿上顯示，阿麥次仁生於1891年3月16號。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155125-g2r9zss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155125-g2r9zss","updated":"20240521155125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"報導說，阿麥次仁老人從小性格開朗、耿直，喜歡吃糌粑、肉末、肉包子等，喜歡喝酥油茶和清茶。目前，西藏百歲老人共有79位，全區人口的平均壽命由1959年之前的35.5歲提高到現在的67歲。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(讀者請看其中可有任何維他命出現，而其個性開朗，與世無爭就是她得以長壽的秘密了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155125-y3mglbr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155125-y3mglbr","updated":"20240521155125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155125-lydqmkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155125-lydqmkd","updated":"20240521155125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   西藥廠為了賺取黑心錢，不斷的宣導多吃維他命C與E可以抗老，這些不實的研究，就被真正出現的長壽人瑞戳穿了它們的謊言，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"現今世界上所有長壽的人瑞，無一位是依靠吃維他命而長壽的，他們都有一共同點，就是保持心情的開朗，一生沒有畏懼"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，上篇中這位人瑞，我敢說她可能連水果都很少吃到，她吃的食物都是當地所產的食物，也沒有吃進口的食物，平淡平實的過日子，也沒有慾望要買名牌衣服首飾等，無慾則剛，每天她都在享受她認為最開心的每一天，她真正是活在天堂之中啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155125-vohflh9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155125-vohflh9","updated":"20240521155125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"   讀者認為她可曾打過各種的疫苗嗎？吃過抗生素或是止痛藥等？我相信現在的人瑞都是住在被西藥廠遺漏的偏遠處所，還有就是因為貧困無法負擔藥費與疫苗跟維他命的費用，因此所以這些人就能得以倖免的獲得長壽與愉快的人生。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155125-qnu59qq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155125-qnu59qq","updated":"20240521155125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    而今天正好有一位女子來訪，她從過去到現在，每天都是一直生活在恐懼當中，因為她被西醫告知，她得到一種疾病是來自家族DNA的遺傳，這種病會讓身體逐漸無力，呼吸逐漸會出現問題，手掌也會出現無法伸張的症狀，而這種病會讓她最多只能存活到四十八歲到五十五歲左右，而她今年是五十歲左右的婦女，她因為相信西醫師說的話，因此她每天都活在即將死亡的陰影之中，心悸不已，焦慮，沮喪，請問讀者，這樣的日子能過嗎? 她去看西醫的結果就是讓她更焦慮更沮喪，這種人就是會被西醫師嚇死的一種人，我檢查了一下她的脈跟一些問診後，我很肯定的告訴她，妳不要害怕，因為妳身體上並沒出現任何的危症，陰陽非常的平衡，這已經表示妳完全沒有會死亡症候，妳不要再回到西醫那裡去做檢查了，因為已經沒有比這西醫說的更壞的消息了，既然已經如此，又何必再回去找西醫呢?"}]},{"ID":"20240521155125-5ap6grv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155125-5ap6grv","updated":"20240521155125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    每次我遇到這種病人時，都是非常氣憤，試問一位醫師去跟病人說，你還能活多久? 這表示什麼? 表示你很行嗎? 錯了，這表示你這位醫師不但無法解決病人的問題，反而給病人帶來更多的問題，這樣做的結果，能讓病人存活嗎? 對病人有什麼益處呢? 真正是只有超爛的醫師才專門幹這種事情，真正的好醫師都是一心一意只想幫助病人解決問題，中醫與西醫，誰強誰弱 ? 在這裡就可以看出來了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155125-f1iyqxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155125-f1iyqxn","updated":"20240521155125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於佛州2009年03月17日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155126-unnmaxu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155126-unnmaxu"}},{"ID":"20240521155132-4i125zp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155132-4i125zp","updated":"20240521155132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"長壽竹森村 人瑞赤腳唱山歌"}]},{"ID":"20240521155132-it4hf34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155132-it4hf34","updated":"20240521155132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【聯合報╱記者范榮達／苗栗縣報導】2009.03.19 03:19 am"}]},{"ID":"20240521155132-tss4p8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155132-tss4p8z","updated":"20240521155132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「孫越四十七歲出唱片，我到八十五歲才敢出門唱山歌，足足慢了卅八年。」苗栗縣銅鑼鄉竹森村人瑞多，社區發展協會正集結出版「竹森寶之林」，活到一○八高齡才去世的邱松妹，說這段話時令人莞爾。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (唱歌是最好的舒壓方式，也是很好的肺臟運動。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155132-ofjre5k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155132-ofjre5k","updated":"20240521155132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"竹森村有一千三百多人，十年前曾有三名百歲人瑞，有人建議改名長壽村，因牽涉太廣而作罷。據苗栗縣政府民政處統計，全縣八十歲以上老人占百分之三，竹森村占百分之六點六四，高出平均值兩倍多，其中九十歲到一百歲十二人，一百歲以上一人。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155132-cm9ogd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155132-cm9ogd6","updated":"20240521155132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"竹森村社區發展協會總幹事鍾兆良說，十年前苗栗縣有卅餘名百歲人瑞，竹森村有三人。「竹森寶之林」由會員彭懷玉採寫，詳細紀錄人瑞的生活點滴，封面人物就是該村享最高壽的「阿祿伯婆」邱松妹，享壽一○八歲。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155132-qy5ajq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155132-qy5ajq0","updated":"20240521155132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苗栗縣大漢之音董事長張強表示，邱松妹生前接受訪問時說，她愛唱山歌，但客家婦女保守、認份，老公八十四歲過世後，她才敢「拋頭露面」唱山歌，一直唱到九十九歲，再遠都自己搭車去，大家佩服她的精神，包紅包給她，數一數至少有二、三十萬元。 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(愛唱歌的人多半都是性格開朗又不喜歡跟別人斤斤計較的人，這是健康的不二法門。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155132-306oc2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155132-306oc2a","updated":"20240521155132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"邱松妹兒子徐火亮說，母親長壽祕訣在於心情開朗，愛唱山歌，後來跌倒才沒有再參賽，她生前健保卡六格都未用完。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(她不看西醫就是她真正能長壽的主要原因啊。台灣的健保制度是讓人短命的制度。 許多長壽人瑞都是因為跌倒後，無法繼續運動，然後才過世的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155132-xasbuqk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155132-xasbuqk","updated":"20240521155132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一百○三歲的劉羅末妹現在是竹森村最長壽人瑞，有雙「從不穿鞋的腳」，前幾年還常看她赤腳到土地公廟拜拜。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (這已經表示她的腳是熱的，完全符合中醫的健全原則，腳熱的人是沒有癌症的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155132-g2ofbdb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155132-g2ofbdb","updated":"20240521155132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"劉羅末妹說，早期農家生活窮困，那有鞋穿，久而久之就習慣了，土地有靈氣，可以促進血液循環，只有赤腳踩在土地上，才有踏實感，何必把腳包得死死的？ "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(預防心臟病的不二法門就是要保冷，她在無意之間做到了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155132-mnyq5zv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155132-mnyq5zv","updated":"20240521155132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"竹森村長徐廷雲認為，竹森村人瑞多，除空氣新鮮，也有好水質，村內有口山泉水，他請環保公司檢驗，水質符合標準。兩年前村內還發起募款鑿井，好東西要與大眾分享，假日取水民眾絡繹不絕。 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(空氣好與水質好是長壽的絕對條件，但是都在山區裡才有。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155132-qh6e71h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155132-qh6e71h","updated":"20240521155132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【2009/03/19 聯合報】@ http://udn.com/"}]},{"ID":"20240521155132-u53ucow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155132-u53ucow","updated":"20240521155132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155132-9gjaydj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155132-9gjaydj","updated":"20240521155132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    直到目前為止，世界上所有長壽的人瑞都有些共同點，第一 : 都住在山區，有好的空氣，第二 : 都有開朗的個性，第三 : 都不吃西藥，都不施打疫苗，也不做每年的定時體檢，第四 : 都有好的水能飲用，第五 : 都不富裕，第六 : 每天都有運動，這些才是他們真正的長壽原因所在，其中沒有一人是喜歡吃維他命的，都在吃當地所產的食物，讀者如果要想長壽的話，請多多學習他們的生活方式，我保證你們也會長壽的。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155132-qodyk4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155132-qodyk4q","updated":"20240521155132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於佛州2009年03月18日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155133-vcdzlpc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155133-vcdzlpc"}},{"ID":"20240521155139-ug69vf7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155139-ug69vf7","updated":"20240521155140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"115歲 全球最高齡"}]},{"ID":"20240521155139-8v8cj8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155139-8v8cj8c","updated":"20240521155139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2007/02/21 16:40 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"記者:編譯夏嘉玲/路透烏克蘭亞歷契夫電"}]},{"ID":"20240521155139-4vv17se","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155139-4vv17se","updated":"20240521155139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"目前全球最高齡者是住在烏克蘭西部的115歲人瑞何利霍利‧涅斯特，他生於19世紀末期的奧匈帝國，經歷過兩次大戰戰火與蘇聯高壓統治。他認為，保持生活與飲食習慣健康是他長壽的原因。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是第二長壽原因。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155139-rsvg3w6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155139-rsvg3w6","updated":"20240521155139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下月15日就要滿116歲的涅斯特個頭矮小，臉上卻蓄了大大的灰色八字鬍。他十分硬朗，可以幫忙清洗馬鈴薯等家務，撐了柺杖也能自己行走家中四處，只是耳背得厲害，對他說話得用吼的，老人家才聽得見。涅斯特由於一貧如洗，終生未娶，目前與他一名已過世的姐妹的孫女歐克撒娜同住。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這裡提到他一貧如洗，我認為這才是他真正長壽的原因，現代的有錢人都短命，原因就是他們相信西醫。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155139-0ha5zkm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155139-0ha5zkm","updated":"20240521155139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"涅斯特蘇聯時期核發的舊護照上出生日期是1891年3月15日，比上個月剛滿114歲、號稱全球最高齡者的日本人瑞皆川還年長近兩歲。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155139-02kuant","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155139-02kuant","updated":"20240521155139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他的甥孫女歐克撒娜說，涅斯特祈求上天讓他活到116歲，「不過他每天都會說世事難料」"}]},{"ID":"20240521155139-305dr2e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155139-305dr2e","updated":"20240521155139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155139-tjbteba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155139-tjbteba","updated":"20240521155139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    目前世界上所有長壽的人瑞的共同點是，在出生時沒有被注射疫苗，因為當時根本沒有這種爛東西，生病時沒有抗生素吃，西藥業不發達，人民生活艱困必須努力工作才能取得食物，接近自然的生活，吃最天然的食物，此人因為一生貧困，所以長壽，西藥廠對窮人是沒有興趣的，所以他就逃過西藥廠的魔手了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155139-1r6m2sg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155139-1r6m2sg","updated":"20240521155139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"結論是 : 現在中國大陸與台灣都已經被西藥廠淪陷了，西藥的毒素從小孩一生下來就被打進生體裡了，自此以後這兩個地方將不再看到有百年人瑞了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155141-ppd8l87","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155141-ppd8l87"}},{"ID":"20240521155147-uiy18qt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155147-uiy18qt","updated":"20240521155148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"嗓子越吊越年輕"}]},{"ID":"20240521155147-c66qj6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155147-c66qj6h","updated":"20240521155147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2007/04/26 17:00"}]},{"ID":"20240521155147-65q5r3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155147-65q5r3e","updated":"20240521155147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"德國研究發現，人類的嗓子得吊，越吊是越年輕。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155147-l39uzav","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155147-l39uzav","updated":"20240521155147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"人老了通常嗓子都會變粗，不過，要是經常的練、經常唱歌，嗓子可以常保青春。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155147-ggdyzuy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155147-ggdyzuy","updated":"20240521155147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荷蘭人瑞演員兼歌手，高齡一百零三歲的(奚斯特)說，他每天固定喊嗓子，從低音開始，越唱越高。到現在還可以唱到男高音的音階。光聽聲音絕對聽不出他已經一百歲了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155147-qc63xha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155147-qc63xha","updated":"20240521155147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155147-7pp1xug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155147-7pp1xug","updated":"20240521155147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   唱歌絕對是長壽的要件之一，而且唱歌時要用力，專注於歌曲的精神所在，要記住歌詞，每天練習，讀者如果做到，我保證你長壽，絕對不要去做體檢，因為你做完後就開始失眠，光是檢驗用的藥物與放射線等，就會傷害你的身體，如果結果出來不好，你就開始害怕，於是無法繼續唱歌，每天都在驚嚇中過日子，食不知味，然後很快就死翹翹了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155147-oa6ismr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155147-oa6ismr","updated":"20240521155147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    我昨天看到我的老師在錄音室中，現場表演他最新的吉他獨奏傑作，真是過癮，他告訴我，我是第一位聽到他新作的人，我真正是走錯行，真想趕快退休去寫地紀，同時去玩音樂，我正在訓練最優秀的傳人之中，一旦完成後，我將專心的練琴與練習唱歌。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155154-9k642ap","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155154-9k642ap"}},{"ID":"20240521155155-t2isk0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155155-t2isk0q","updated":"20240521155155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"卡路里少三成 可延緩老化"}]},{"ID":"20240521155155-brxm0pl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155155-brxm0pl","updated":"20240521155155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2009/07/11 04:09"}]},{"ID":"20240521155155-3c3557n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155155-3c3557n","updated":"20240521155155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔編譯羅彥傑／綜合九日外電報導〕美國科學家九日表示，一份針對恆河猴老化的二十年研究顯示，低卡路里的飲食可減少老年常見疾病並大幅延長壽命，而且或許也適用於同為靈長類物種的人類。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155155-m51wvkb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155155-m51wvkb","updated":"20240521155155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"恆河猴20年研究 證實靈長類少吃抗老化"}]},{"ID":"20240521155155-gv7nvpp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155155-gv7nvpp","updated":"20240521155155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這種稱為卡路里限量（caloric restriction）的飲食，包含所有正常健康成分，但卡路里較一般飲食少了三成。威斯康辛大學麥迪遜校區的柯曼與溫德魯奇研究團隊，在九日刊登於權威期刊「科學」的研究報告中指出，恆河猴在攝取卡路里限量飲食後，因罹患心臟病、癌症與糖尿病等老化疾病而死亡的機率，要比對照組低三倍。換句話說，卡路里限量飲食可延緩靈長類物種的老化過程。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這就是貧人比富人來得長壽原因思所在。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155155-ijy569r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155155-ijy569r","updated":"20240521155155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二十多年前，科學家開始進行以恆河猴為對象的兩份研究計畫，以觀察靈長類動物對於卡路里減量的反應是否與老鼠相同，柯曼與溫德魯奇的研究計畫便是其中之一。由於恆河猴平均壽命為二十七歲，最高甚至可活到四十歲，因此實驗需耐心等待。報告指出，二十年後，抑制卡路里的諸多益處已開始出現在這些猴子身上，包括大幅減少糖尿病、癌症及心臟與腦部疾病罹患率等，減幅高達三倍。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(少吃些，不要吃太飽，就是長壽的秘訣。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155155-7fjnwha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155155-7fjnwha","updated":"20240521155155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就死亡率而言，對照組猴子截至目前有三成七死於老化，而被餵食卡路里限量飲食的猴子則僅一成三。由於很少人能持續採用比正常量低三成卡路里的飲食法，所以生物學家已開始物色可能產生卡路里限量效果的藥物，俾能得其利而避其害。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(千萬不可以這樣做，這已經違反自然原則，不需要研發這種藥，只要減少食物的攝取就可以了。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155155-paeio7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155155-paeio7o","updated":"20240521155155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155155-q1aavim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155155-q1aavim","updated":"20240521155155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   這種長壽的秘訣在我國是司空見慣的，所有得到高僧都是長年空腹的練功打坐，有所謂的斷食療法，或是只喝開水，無論是哪一種方法，但是方向都是一致的。就是減少對食物的攝取，我在診所看診時，一般都不吃早餐，因為這樣可以讓我思路清晰，也很奇怪的是我並不感覺到很餓，精神體力也很好，這是很自然形成的一個習慣，不需要刻意去逼自己做，一切順其自然最好。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155155-a7um9v5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155155-a7um9v5","updated":"20240521155155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2009年07月11日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155157-8zutpvs","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155157-8zutpvs"}},{"ID":"20240521155203-v95lx0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155203-v95lx0o","updated":"20240521155203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"107歲壽星 86子孫迎風慶生"}]},{"ID":"20240521155203-x1nzj7m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155203-x1nzj7m","updated":"20240521155203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中國時報【林和生／屏東報導】 2009-08-08"}]},{"ID":"20240521155203-trvicyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155203-trvicyu","updated":"20240521155203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"屏東最年長的人瑞彭玉梅，7日歡度107歲生日，晚輩不懼颱風侵襲，南下幫「該巫」祝壽。（林和生攝"}]},{"ID":"20240521155203-ldswl34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155203-ldswl34","updated":"20240521155203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"住在三地門青葉村、全屏東最年長的人瑞彭玉梅，八月七日度過她一百零七歲生日，子孫五代超過八十人，不畏中颱莫拉克強風暴雨從各地趕到，不喜張揚的她，事前只要求一個蛋糕及後輩親口吟唱的生日快樂歌，在風雨交加與眾人祝福，慶祝場面格外溫馨。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155203-mu5ihos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155203-mu5ihos","updated":"20240521155203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    　生於一九○三年的彭玉梅，是部落有名的國寶級原住民織布大師，村內織布工作者幾乎全傳承她手藝，育有二子、四女，五代同堂共有七十九人，最小玄孫年僅六個月大，年齡足足相差一個世紀以上。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155203-2mfplon","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155203-2mfplon","updated":"20240521155203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    　孫子輩退休教官楊智明表示，「該巫」（魯凱族祖母意思）生日是家族大日子，擔心被颱風打亂行程，前幾天後輩們即陸續從台北、新竹、台中南下，共有八十六人參與，但她幾個月前就再三強調，這次慶生不要張揚，只要求一個蛋糕及全家團圓，因為她覺得自己已經很幸福，這樣就足夠了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155203-ukt4w3x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155203-ukt4w3x","updated":"20240521155203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    　楊智明說，篤信基督教的彭玉梅，僅說母語，也會聽簡單的國語，觀念傳統，常叮嚀晚輩外出要穿正式原服，也要求多說母語，避免原民文化式微。她不菸不酒，三餐清淡，偶爾吃吃檳榔，放寬心胸是養生之道。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(長壽的人是不吃西藥的，同時也從不做體檢的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155203-t318w37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155203-t318w37","updated":"20240521155203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     彭玉梅是國寶級的原住民織布大師，部落內的織布工作者，都是她教出來的子孫輩。她三餐吃地瓜、野菜、小米酒，最愛黑豬肉，雖已一百多歲，但記憶特好，每個子孫姓名通通都記得，連部落內的小朋友也記得。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" (長壽的人是不吃西藥的，同時也從不做體檢的。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155203-ffqijlo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155203-ffqijlo","updated":"20240521155203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"彭玉梅以前還自己洗衣服、澆花，這兩年因眼睛感染蜂窩性組織炎，現在要拄拐杖行走，不過每晚一定會看電視劇。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155203-kxl4yt6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155203-kxl4yt6","updated":"20240521155203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    　彭玉梅受訪總是有問必答，還特地透過孫女轉達說「自己老了，有問題就盡管問，把它用文字記錄下來，不然哪天走了，就沒得問了」，在在顯示顯示老阿嬤的體貼及對原民文化消失的掛念。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155203-dv8t58c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155203-dv8t58c","updated":"20240521155203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155203-ip56mqn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155203-ip56mqn","updated":"20240521155203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   世間本無事，庸人自擾之。要想開心的過活，第一就要了解去做體檢不但沒用，反而會被嚇出病來，讓你人生的每一天都在檢查你的數字在過活，精神的重心都在驗血報告上，我ㄧ生從不做任何體檢，因為自己就是最好的體檢師，只有自己知道自己怎麼了，別人怎會知道呢?"}]},{"ID":"20240521155203-pwr9u72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155203-pwr9u72","updated":"20240521155203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   此人粗茶淡飯，不煙不酒，每天保持心情開朗，這就是長壽之道啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155203-7hwy34s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155203-7hwy34s","updated":"20240521155203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於佛州2009年08月07日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155204-mg787qg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155204-mg787qg"}},{"ID":"20240521155212-qxyq12f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155212-qxyq12f","updated":"20240521155212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"轉貼來自大陸支援網站Kathreen所貼報導"}]},{"ID":"20240521155212-stfb63v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155212-stfb63v","updated":"20240521155212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1976年哥伦比亚的堡高塔市的医生罢工52天,出现了一个被称为“不寻常的副作用”：就是当地死亡率下降了35%\n　　同年，在美国洛杉矶，当医生对医疗事故保险涨价不满而罢工示威时，全市病人死亡率下降了18%\n　　1973年，以色列全国医生大罢工。为期长达一个月，根据耶路撒冷埋葬协会的统计指出该月的全国死亡人数下降了50%。\n　　十年后，1983年，以色列医生再次举行全国总罢工，这次罢工的时间长，长达85天，神奇的事情发生了：过后，以色列耶路撒冷埋葬协会又做了一次统计，在这85天中，全国人口的死亡率又下降了50%。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155212-y9y43lm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155212-y9y43lm","updated":"20240521155212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　波美特拉博士（Dr.BrucePomerant）对80年代西方国家医生罢工与死亡率下降的调查指出：死亡率的下降与医生罢工日期的长短成正比。\n　　1、例如在加拿大曼尼涛巴省（Manitoba）的医生罢工两周，死亡率下降为20%。\n　　2、在不列颠哥伦比亚省（BritishColumbia）的医生罢工3周，死亡率下降为30%。\n　　3、在以色列医生罢工85天，全国死亡率下降则为50%。\n　　也就是说，西医的医生罢工时间越长，全国的死亡率越低，目前世界记录是降低50%"}]},{"ID":"20240521155212-pvq2h4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155212-pvq2h4v","updated":"20240521155212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　　目前中国每月死亡100万人。假如全中国的西医罢工3个月，原来3个月死亡300万人，降低到死亡150万人。也就是说，中国的西医大罢工3个月，能让150万人避免死亡，相当于一个城市的人口免于死亡。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155212-7j38gpl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155212-7j38gpl","updated":"20240521155212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155212-qj9htd1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155212-qj9htd1","updated":"20240521155212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    我以前推薦的一本書，叫做－醫學背叛者的告白－(Confessions of a Medical Heretic 作者是 Robert S Mendelsohn, M.D.)，其中就以經將這個事實報導出來，每當西醫師去罷工時，當時的死亡率就立刻跟著下降，從數字來看也可以證明西醫學在殺人是沒有疑慮的，西醫學只能用於外科急救，不能用於內科治病的。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155212-tv74xqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155212-tv74xqx","updated":"20240521155212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海厦謹記於佛州2009年08月23日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155213-zp9rusu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155213-zp9rusu"}},{"ID":"20240521155218-wne4ei7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155218-wne4ei7","updated":"20240521155218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大馬人瑞嬤107歲 猶思梅開23度"}]},{"ID":"20240521155218-8w1povy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155218-8w1povy","updated":"20240521155218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2009/09/15 00:07 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"【中央社吉隆坡14日法新電】"}]},{"ID":"20240521155218-ggz7u7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155218-ggz7u7v","updated":"20240521155218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"媒體今天報導，107歲的馬來西亞老婦烏坤督（WookKundor）表示，因為擔心有毒癮的現任丈夫會為了年輕女郎拋棄她，她已準備梅開23度。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155218-ycdpvyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155218-ycdpvyu","updated":"20240521155218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"烏坤督4年前在北部的丁加奴州（Terengganu）嫁給小她70歲的穆罕默德（MuhammadNoorCheMusa），轟動一時，當地媒體爭相報導，並刊登兩人的結婚照片。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155218-3rvvcs0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155218-3rvvcs0","updated":"20240521155218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如今烏坤督告訴「星報」（Star），她正尋找新歡，因為她擔心37歲的穆罕默德在首都吉隆坡的自願戒毒療程結束後，會離她而去。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155218-gxq5qmu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155218-gxq5qmu","updated":"20240521155218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她說：「我明白我是上了年紀的女人。我的身材走樣，也不再是有吸引力的妙齡女郎。」"}]},{"ID":"20240521155218-neqkiwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155218-neqkiwq","updated":"20240521155218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「我改嫁的想法是為了填補若有所失，僅此而已。」她補充說，沒有丈夫陪她歡度下週的穆斯林節慶「開齋節」（Eidal-Fitr），讓她芳心寂寥。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(看來有愛才是長壽的秘訣。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155218-ffn8s2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155218-ffn8s2b","updated":"20240521155218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾是烏坤督房客的穆罕默德稍早曾說，他倆相愛是「神的旨意」。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155218-tgm23x6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155218-tgm23x6","updated":"20240521155218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155218-47rf0jn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155218-47rf0jn","updated":"20240521155218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   這篇報導證明了一點，一直有愛是長壽的秘訣之ㄧ，絕對不是吃西藥而可以長壽的，西藥吃的越多，人體就越差，於是就越短命。直到目前為止，世界上沒有一位長壽的人瑞是依靠每天吃西藥而獲得長壽的。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155218-iu1wwux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155218-iu1wwux","updated":"20240521155218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2009年09月20日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155218-47rjocx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155218-47rjocx"}},{"ID":"20240521155227-n1h5wcs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155227-n1h5wcs","updated":"20240521155230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"河南107歲老太太又長新牙 5代同堂60多口"}]},{"ID":"20240521155227-jjt4fkk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155227-jjt4fkk","updated":"20240521155227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2009/09/18 11:05"}]},{"ID":"20240521155227-uwfwn26","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155227-uwfwn26","updated":"20240521155227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大陸河南省伊川縣一位107歲的老太太日前又長出了二顆新牙，實屬罕見。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(在過去沒有西醫藥的年代，這種情形一點也不稀奇。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155227-mp09uip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155227-mp09uip","updated":"20240521155227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中新網報導，這名老太太名叫(焦珍娃)，她出生於l903年3月l3號，今年l07歲。l994年被評為(中國百名長壽老人)，榮獲(鐵樹花杯)證書和獎品。2003年被評為洛陽市(十大壽星)，榮獲(健康杯)證書和金匾。2004年又被洛陽市授予(百歲壽星)稱號，榮獲金匾和證書。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155227-7chhshf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155227-7chhshf","updated":"20240521155227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"焦珍娃共有兩個兒子，13個孫子孫女，五代同堂共60多口人。更驚奇的是，2002年時她一不小心摔倒，右手臂骨折，做了接骨手術後不到一年老太太就完全復康，沒留任何後遺症，連醫生都感到驚奇。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是人體正常的狀態，有何驚奇之有，人體中最強的就是骨骼啊。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155227-0gxqqmp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155227-0gxqqmp","updated":"20240521155227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155227-tzbmh26","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155227-tzbmh26","updated":"20240521155227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     這篇報導正好證明了西藥之害，人體內的器官與組織在正常的狀態之下，本來就是被設計成可以健康的存活百年以上的，直到二百年前西醫藥開始發展以後就被改變了，我有一位女病人來自加州，年紀只有四十左右，由於她極端的相信西醫藥，只要出現血糖稍高就去吃降血糖藥，血壓稍高就去吃降壓藥，尿酸稍高就去吃降尿酸藥，膽固醇稍高就吃降膽固醇藥，平時就吃鈣片想來加強骨質的密度，長年這樣做的結果，適得其反的造成她現在就已經出現骨質疏鬆症，然後又去吃治療骨質疏鬆症的西藥(Forsarmax)，這種藥物不但無法補充骨質，而它的副作用就是造成她的上額牙床骨消失，導致左側的牙齒脫落，現在是全身骨質都疏鬆了，這種人因為迷信西藥而自找苦吃的案例非常之多，尤其在台灣更是無法盡數，真是一群迷信西醫藥的可憐蟲，我時常對這種人說一句話，就是---我國有許多千年以上的古屍出土，其所有器官都已經爛掉，唯有骨骼還在 長，這已經說明了人體的骨骼本來是金剛不壞的，現在因為西藥的氾濫，已經出現有人都還沒死，就已經得到骨質疏鬆症，真正是因為迷信西藥而笨死的一群人，上篇報導證實了我說的是對的，我敢保證這位老太太，絕對沒有吃過西藥，甚至於連鈣片都沒吃過，才有可能出現如此好的身體狀況。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155227-vkrlyzz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155227-vkrlyzz","updated":"20240521155227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2009年09月20日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155233-s7gerjx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155233-s7gerjx"}},{"ID":"20240521155239-t48axcr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155239-t48axcr","updated":"20240521155239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全球最長壽人瑞歡度113歲生日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155239-3ym8thl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155239-3ym8thl","updated":"20240521155239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2009/09/22 11:05"}]},{"ID":"20240521155239-1b929ey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155239-1b929ey","updated":"20240521155239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"全球最長壽人瑞今天歡度113歲生日。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155239-8w3ygvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155239-8w3ygvv","updated":"20240521155239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"住在美國蒙大拿一個養老社區的（布魯寧）今天賀客盈門，蒙大拿州長（史懷哲）也登門祝壽，除了幾乎堆滿房間的生日禮物之外，他還獲得教會會友合贈的一萬美元，布魯寧立刻把錢捐出來，給當地的一個治療兒童語言發展遲緩的機構。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155239-h8f86rs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155239-h8f86rs","updated":"20240521155239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"布魯寧老先生生於1896年，在鐵路公司服務了半個世紀，他說他長壽的秘訣在於維持優質飲食、維持身體以及腦部運動，他還透露，他每天吃一顆阿斯匹靈。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(他必定是近十年來才這樣做，以前沒有是因為十年前西醫才開始說每天吃一片阿斯匹靈，可以預防心臟病。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155239-p9ngah9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155239-p9ngah9","updated":"20240521155239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155239-hoh0tq6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155239-hoh0tq6","updated":"20240521155239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   此人真正長壽的原因是維持優質飲食、維持身體以及腦部運動，還有他住的地方必定有好空氣與好水質，絕對不是因為每天吃一片阿斯匹靈而得到長壽的，讀者千萬不要誤解，每天吃一片阿斯匹靈的結果只會讓他短命，而且是腦溢血或是動脈血管剝離而死的，如果吃太多的阿斯匹靈，還有機會得到胰臟癌的。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155239-0glr83w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155239-0glr83w","updated":"20240521155239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2009年09月22日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155240-d68vwmx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155240-d68vwmx"}},{"ID":"20240521155247-65xhyxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155247-65xhyxv","updated":"20240521155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"清代人瑞142歲 史上最長壽紀錄"}]},{"ID":"20240521155247-siq3cxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155247-siq3cxu","updated":"20240521155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中國時報【王銘義／綜合報導】2009-10-15"}]},{"ID":"20240521155247-vzwhiwr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155247-vzwhiwr","updated":"20240521155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"百歲人瑞，在世上應算是「超級古來稀」的生命現象，但廣西著名長壽鄉：巴馬瑤族自治縣從清代檔案發現，當地曾出現一四二歲超級人瑞存活的紀錄，這項衝擊人類生命極限的「世界最長壽」紀錄，引起各方驚嘆和質疑。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這是空氣好，水質好造成的，加上沒有吃過各種綜合維他命與西藥，這就是他長壽的真正原因。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155247-zk3ksrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155247-zk3ksrs","updated":"20240521155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    　國際自然醫學會近年曾向廣西巴馬瑤族自治縣頒布「世界第五個長壽鄉」證書。巴馬養生環境與長壽話題即成為輿論界關注焦點。近來歷史研究者更發現，清代嘉慶皇帝曾給當地一位壽命高達一四二歲瑤族老人藍祥題詩祝壽。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(清朝時我國完全沒有西藥廠，所以能長壽。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155247-t7cvqnw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155247-t7cvqnw","updated":"20240521155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    　據《歷史檔案》期刊披露，中國第一歷史檔案館清代檔案中有四件記載藍祥的珍貴檔案：一是廣西巡撫錢楷給嘉慶的奏折，二是軍機處抄錄錢楷奏折，三是錢楷給嘉慶的奏片，四是嘉慶上諭。這些檔案記載了藍祥的生存狀況。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155247-3qrwqng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155247-3qrwqng","updated":"20240521155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    　其中，嘉慶十五年（一八一○年）十一月，錢楷給嘉慶的奏摺寫道：「據宜山縣知縣周冕稟報，該縣永定土司境內壽民藍祥生於康熙八年（一六六九年），屆今一四二歲。現存曾孫二人、元孫一人侍養。因該村在崇山峻嶺之中，人跡罕到，以致曩時失於查報」云云。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(此人居住的地方人跡罕到，空氣與水一定沒有被污染過。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155247-uuior46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155247-uuior46","updated":"20240521155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    　嘉慶看到錢楷的奏摺非常高興，隨後發出一道諭旨：「壽民藍祥加恩賞給六品頂戴，並特頒御制詩章及匾額外，著禮部查照舊例加等擬賞具奏，以示惠錫敦寵至意。」"}]},{"ID":"20240521155247-tfbuqb2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155247-tfbuqb2","updated":"20240521155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    　清代稱百歲壽星為「熙朝人瑞」，由地方逐級上報，並取得族鄰證明，由禮部核實，請旨旌表，給予獎勵。據稱，嘉慶對這位罕見壽星除賞給六品頂戴，並特頒御制詩章，還破例賞銀二百兩、緞五匹，更賞賜藍祥《重頤吉慶》御制匾額，隆重表彰長壽老人的生命奇蹟。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(此人有幸存活於過去的年代，完全沒有被西藥污染過，所以能長壽。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155247-hldp8xb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155247-hldp8xb","updated":"20240521155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    　至於藍祥老人何時去世，清代檔案並無確切記載，但至少活到一四二歲；同時，藍祥是廣西宜山縣人（今宜州市），不是巴馬縣人，這是確定無疑的。御制詩章、御筆匾額、牌坊已被歷史所湮沒無存，但中國第一歷史檔案館藏清代檔案則記載了這段人類生命極限的歷史。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155247-5s1e1fn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155247-5s1e1fn","updated":"20240521155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155247-3kqkpx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155247-3kqkpx8","updated":"20240521155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    好空氣與好水質，絕對是長壽的不二法門，現代人居住在城市中，好空氣已經不可能有了，水質也已經被亂吃西藥的人污染了，水中含有超高的女性賀爾蒙，就是這樣來的，連水中的魚類都出現同性戀，讀者想想有多可怕，西藥廠不消失，人類的壽命必將變短，這是絕對可以預見的一種結果。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155247-6um1bc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155247-6um1bc5","updated":"20240521155247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2009年10月15日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155247-ouzyw7h","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155247-ouzyw7h"}},{"ID":"20240521155254-9m7srqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155254-9m7srqq","updated":"20240521155254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"雄中門生賀壽 105歲老校長人氣旺"}]},{"ID":"20240521155254-6glojg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155254-6glojg8","updated":"20240521155254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【聯合報╱記者徐如宜高雄市報導】2009.10.02 02:54 am"}]},{"ID":"20240521155254-19a5k3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155254-19a5k3m","updated":"20240521155254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「祝老校長歡喜呷百二。」高雄中學老校長王家驥昨天慶祝一百零五歲壽誕，市長陳菊與雄中畢業的副市長李永得，以及同為雄中校友的前考試院長許水德、監委趙榮耀、立委丁守中等人一起前往賀壽。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155254-mjuq9t0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155254-mjuq9t0","updated":"20240521155254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「真是慚愧慚愧，謝謝大家。」王家驥看著故舊門生齊聚一堂為他祝壽，未說太多話，但看得出十分高興。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155254-j5lrl06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155254-j5lrl06","updated":"20240521155254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"王家驥的生日是民國前六年農曆八月十三日，擔任雄中校長廿四年，桃李滿天下。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155254-f5wjcb5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155254-f5wjcb5","updated":"20240521155254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"許水德推崇王家驥是「無私奉獻的教育家」，直言如果台灣多幾位像老校長這樣胸懷的人，社會就不會這麼亂了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155254-wrlobfi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155254-wrlobfi","updated":"20240521155254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"許水德和丁守中回想就讀雄中的日子說，老校長很重視德智體群美五育均衡發展，美術及音樂不及格會留級。當時同學覺得不近情理，後來才了解老校長的用心。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155254-dgckqx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155254-dgckqx8","updated":"20240521155254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"校友們一起為老校長唱生日快樂歌，切三層大蛋糕賀壽。雄中前校長潘輝雄、現任校長黃秀霞和校友們，引吭高唱雄中校歌。老校長非常開心，不斷微微頷首。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155254-56oybho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155254-56oybho","updated":"20240521155254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"老校長人氣超旺，小小的客廳擠滿了祝壽的人。許水德說，王家驥九十大壽時，當時的總統李登輝來探視；一百歲大壽時，陳水扁也來賀壽過；今年總統馬英九原本也要來，但無法分身，先送匾祝賀。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155254-6gjvy7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155254-6gjvy7g","updated":"20240521155254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"四代同堂的王家驥平日由媳婦陳麗惠照料，他"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"早晨七時起床、中午午休、晚上九時就寢，生活規律"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。眾人問他長壽的秘訣，他說，不過是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"順其自然、不強求，心情保持愉快。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155254-x9hbzfq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155254-x9hbzfq","updated":"20240521155254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【2009/10/02 聯合報】@ http://udn.com/"}]},{"ID":"20240521155254-ur9lmjt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155254-ur9lmjt","updated":"20240521155254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155254-884gt9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155254-884gt9c","updated":"20240521155254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   這位百齡人瑞雖然是位已經退休的校長，但是由他能長壽的原因就可以知道，此人一生不貪，絕不收人紅包，絕對是一位正直有氣節的校長，上篇報導中我用紅字劃出來的部份就是他長壽的秘訣，我們都應該效法他的作為，真正是人之師表。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155254-jhsm7pq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155254-jhsm7pq","updated":"20240521155254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   許多人心中只有名牌、精品的人要注意了，這些慾求只會讓你們生病、一生過的不開心，人生苦短，為何要去做只追求名牌、只相信名牌的敗金族呢？如果是因為拜金而變成敗犬一族，結果必然更壞。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155254-4yz06t5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155254-4yz06t5","updated":"20240521155254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2009年10月17日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155256-vvp80c2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155256-vvp80c2"}},{"ID":"20240521155303-qcjk4wg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155303-qcjk4wg","updated":"20240521155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中國首座隕石坑 古龍村民很長壽"}]},{"ID":"20240521155303-uctxexd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155303-uctxexd","updated":"20240521155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2009/12/21 03:08 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"連雋偉／綜合報導"}]},{"ID":"20240521155303-cjcqe8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155303-cjcqe8n","updated":"20240521155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中國時報【連雋偉／綜合報導】"}]},{"ID":"20240521155303-xb44jtf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155303-xb44jtf","updated":"20240521155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"全球至今已發現一百七十多個隕石撞擊坑，中國卻沒半個，大陸科學家經三年努力，證實遼寧岫巖坑就是隕石撞擊坑，也是中國第一個被發現且證實的隕石坑。有趣的是，目前坑內住有六十四戶人家，村民很少生病，是有名的長壽村。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(長壽的原因是因為該村居民沒有被西藥汙染。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155303-wqcxav4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155303-wqcxav4","updated":"20240521155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《北京科技報》曾經報導，「井裡浮油，黑土能燒」在遼寧省岫岩滿族自治縣蘇子溝鎮古龍村總發生這樣的怪事。事實上，這裡的村民從井裡取上來的水都浮著一層油，且黑土挖出曬乾扔到火裡就能燃燒。古龍村地貌是個環形大坑，當地村民稱之為「圈裡」。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155303-x6boi2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155303-x6boi2n","updated":"20240521155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自古以來，古龍村村民對上述現象始終迷惑不已。「圈裡人」祖祖輩輩生活在這，因為交通不便，村民靠上山養蠶和耕種來維持生活。目前，圈裡共有六十四戶人家，有卅戶姓逢。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(就是因為交通不便，所以西藥廠根本就不會去那裡，因為人不多，沒有多少錢可以賺。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155303-byrfwdh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155303-byrfwdh","updated":"20240521155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中科院廣州地質所研究員何宏平指出，這裡村民生活落後，生活方式基本是自給自足。另外，該村被山體包圍，基本不受外界干擾，所以，當地這些現象都與大坑有關。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(該村被山體包圍，基本不受外界干擾，這才是真正長壽的原因所在。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155303-16y3ii0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155303-16y3ii0","updated":"20240521155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然而大坑是怎麼來的？當地人一直無從知曉。中科院廣州地球化學研究所陳鳴等人員經三年努力，近日終於找到隕石強烈撞擊導致岩石發生變形、碎裂和局部熔融，以及岩石和礦物發生衝擊變質的一系列證據。陳鳴等人近日將他們的研究成果發表在《科學通報》上，正式證實遼寧岫巖坑就是一個隕石撞擊坑。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155303-j56jmj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155303-j56jmj4","updated":"20240521155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"據與陳鳴同屬於一個研究組的何宏平介紹說：「從四周山嶺登高向下觀望該隕石坑，整個坑形態呈碗狀。撞擊坑直徑一．八公里，坑深一五○公尺。」陳鳴通過對坑內物質分析，初步確定隕石撞擊事件發生在五萬年前。同時，也對現在的岫岩坑地貌作出合理推測。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155303-k3us5k6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155303-k3us5k6","updated":"20240521155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陳鳴進一步認為，隕石撞擊坑形成後，坑內積水形成小湖泊，並沈積上百米厚湖泊沈積物。推估在大約三．九萬年前，由於地勢較低的「岫岩坑」東部形成缺口，湖泊消失，演變為如今所看到的碗形凹地。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155303-v5lhegr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155303-v5lhegr","updated":"20240521155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155303-xfuexfv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155303-xfuexfv","updated":"20240521155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   目前世界上只要出現長壽的村落，全都清一色的是被隔絕的村莊，交通不便所以人民需要多走路，沒有汽車所以空氣很好，沒有西藥殘留在環境裡，所以水質都非常好，再加上沒有疫苗與抗生素的濫用，也沒有什麼騙人的健康食品，當然更沒有各種琳琅滿目的維他命，住在這種環境中，想不長壽還很難的，小孩子從小就在泥巴裡打滾，食物掉在地上，撿起來就吃，這樣怎會生病呢？"}]},{"ID":"20240521155303-tv5ciys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155303-tv5ciys","updated":"20240521155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    台灣的健康食品已經氾濫成災，這些所謂的健康食品不但沒有讓人健康，還會害人得到癌症，近日來我ㄧ位好友的妹妹，得到林巴癌，她就是最喜歡去買各種健康食品來吃，於是得到今日的惡果，真是花錢買災、買短命的動作，請支持我的民眾聽好，不要再吃各種所謂的健康食品了。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155303-mlvglyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155303-mlvglyq","updated":"20240521155303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2009年12月21日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155303-qeulnr1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155303-qeulnr1"}},{"ID":"20240521155311-ibiye73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155311-ibiye73","updated":"20240521155311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"她也做到了 98歲戒菸成功"}]},{"ID":"20240521155311-0yrd8pg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155311-0yrd8pg","updated":"20240521155311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/01/10 04:11"}]},{"ID":"20240521155311-u30berf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155311-u30berf","updated":"20240521155311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔記者廖雪茹／竹北報導〕人瑞成功戒菸！新竹縣竹北市老人安養中心最年長的98歲住民莊欽，不識字卻很愛寫字，信仰虔誠的她，還擔任聖堂領經人；莊老太太由於肺積水住院，在周邊親友的鼓勵下戒菸療養，一個多月前再度回到中心，重拾快樂生活。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(此人抽菸一生，卻沒有得到肺癌，她證明了西醫學是錯誤的醫學。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155311-66e3ffs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155311-66e3ffs","updated":"20240521155311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出生中國廣東陸豐客家庄的莊欽，原來在國民黨部隊服役，32歲時，與同是軍人的先生遷居台灣，之後夫婦倆在台北賣豆腐為生，育有5男2女；不過先生早在30幾年前過世，她獨力扶養7個孩子，一直到兒女成家立業，93年起主動提議要住進竹北市老人安養中心，與其他老人一同安享寧靜生活。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155311-gct1bqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155311-gct1bqd","updated":"20240521155311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莊欽與安養中心主任張旭興，因宗教信仰結識，十多年來一直是心情分享的心靈夥伴。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155311-nsdgpi4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155311-nsdgpi4","updated":"20240521155311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莊老太太雖年近百歲，但頭腦清晰，樂觀又好客，很喜歡與訪客擂茶、聊天，話閘子一開啟就停不了。信仰虔誠的她，每天早晨起床後，就手持念珠朗誦玫瑰經，20分鐘不間斷，目不識丁卻很愛練習寫字、認字，親友們都將她當作寶。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155311-m98zajh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155311-m98zajh","updated":"20240521155311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不過，莊老太太長年抽菸，97年一度因肺積水住院療養，療養期間，張旭興數度前往探視、天天為她祈禱。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155311-bfc9igr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155311-bfc9igr","updated":"20240521155311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"張旭興說，莊老太太正向思考、生命力很強；從年輕時開始抽菸的她，原本一天要抽一包，靠著意志力與親友的鼓勵戒掉抽菸習慣，身體也漸漸恢復健康。去年11月她再度「回家」，坐著輪椅自理生活，重新領引教友們唸經，大家都替她感到高興。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155311-kqekv7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155311-kqekv7s","updated":"20240521155311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"新的一年，張旭興特地將30位阿公、阿婆的全體照製成賀卡，分送給安養中心的恩人們，祝福大家永遠健康、心想事成。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155311-txbn99i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155311-txbn99i","updated":"20240521155311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155311-rv712k7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155311-rv712k7","updated":"20240521155311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   此人抽菸一生，卻沒有像西醫說的會得到肺癌，抽菸不好是事實，但是與肺癌無關，女人會得到肺癌的真正原因與長期服用女性荷爾蒙有關，西藥廠將這真正導致肺癌的原因，轉嫁給香菸，於是民眾就以為是抽菸才得到肺癌的，事實上卻不是如此，這位長壽老太太的案例就是證據，證明了西醫學是錯誤的醫學。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155311-o1qffkx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155311-o1qffkx","updated":"20240521155311"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年01月10日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155311-etc0tyv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155311-etc0tyv"}},{"ID":"20240521155319-skpdaxj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-skpdaxj","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"諾貝爾獎得主 總結出 抗衰老秘訣  5把鑰匙打開長壽門"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-94vgw80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-94vgw80","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本報記者    2009年12月08日   來源：人民網-《生命時報》"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-1dgb40b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-1dgb40b","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果你想活到100歲，也許可以從諾貝爾獎得主身上找答案。英國一項研究結果顯示，諾貝爾獎得主普遍長壽，平均壽命高達77.2歲，比僅獲得提名的科學家平均壽命高1.4歲。日前，據美國《讀者文摘》報導，2009年諾貝爾生理學或醫學獎得主—伊莉莎白·布萊克本、卡蘿爾·格雷德和傑克·紹斯塔克總結出幾把延緩人類衰老的“鑰匙”，幫你開啟長壽大門。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-8792gzn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-8792gzn","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"長壽金鑰匙——樂觀，生活有目標"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-nu750oq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-nu750oq","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“人要想健康活到100歲，心理平衡的作用占50％以上，合理膳食占25％，其他占25％。”衛生部首席健康教育專家洪昭光告訴《生命時報》記者，其中，心理平衡的作用超過了一切保健措施和保健品的總和，誰能保持心態平衡，就等於掌握了身體健康的金鑰匙。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-df5g5j1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-df5g5j1","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洪昭光表示，一項在世界三大長壽地區進行的調查，以及上海、北京市長壽老人的調查都得出同樣的啟示：要健身，先健心。有了心理健康，才能生理健康。各國長壽地區的人種、氣候、食物、生活習俗各不相同，有的甚至相反，如有的老人嗜煙酒，有的老人喜吃肥肉，但有一點卻中外都相同，那就是長壽者都心胸寬闊，樂觀開朗，心地善良、隨和。沒有一位老人心胸狹窄，鼠肚雞腸，這樣的人活不到100歲。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(請懷恨我的西醫師藥師與造謠生事的人要注意這一點，由於你們就是這一族群的人，所以你們必然會短命，希望你們都能學到這一點，這樣你們才會比較長壽，活得長一點也更有時間來跟我抗衡啊。你們以我為敵人，而我因為沒有敵人，只有疾病是我的敵人，所以我每天都好開心。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-3pb68tm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-3pb68tm","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"幾位諾貝爾獎得主也強調，保持良好的心理狀態，一是要樂觀。美國婦女健康研究（WHI）調查了10萬名婦女，樂觀者在該研究的前8年死亡的危險比悲觀者小14%。 研究者希拉蕊·廷德爾博士指出：“樂觀是重要的保護傘，這種人有強大的社會網路並能很好地處理壓力。”二是有目標。美國拉什大學醫學中心一項涉及1200多位老人的新研究發現，無論是遠大目標，還是旅遊或讀書等近期目標，只要生活擁有目標，生存優勢就更大。研究中，生活有明確目標及計畫的老人，死亡率比其他老人降低一半。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(我ㄧ生的目標就是要消滅西藥廠。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-ts2a01r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-ts2a01r","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二把鑰匙——堅持步行“三五七”"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-l9coue1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-l9coue1","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"世界頂尖心臟病專家、紐約哥倫比亞醫學院OZ博士表示，保持年輕的最好方法是散步。如果5分鐘走不了1/4英里（約400米），那麼在3年內死亡的幾率會驟增。可能的話，儘量與配偶一道散步，有助增加說話機會；一起打網球還能建立親密關係。但這並非鍛煉的全部好處。更重要的是：生命在於運動，夫妻多活動，雙方更能延年益壽。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-av1drm4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-av1drm4","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1992年，世界衛生組織就指出，步行是世界上最好的運動。不僅可以減少糖尿病的發病率，還能降低高血脂，使動脈硬化變軟，讓人腦子更清楚，防止老年癡呆。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-6ha3n98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-6ha3n98","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那麼，怎麼步行最好呢？ 洪昭光表示，掌握好3個字即可：三、五、七。“三”指最好每天步行約3公里，時間在30分鐘以上；“五”指每週運動5次左右，只有有規律的健身運動才能有效；“七”指有氧運動強度以“運動後心率+年齡=170左右”為宜。這相當於一般人中等強度的運動。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-517yxkr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-517yxkr","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如說50歲的人，運動後心率達到120次／分鐘，50+120=170。如果身體素質好，有運動基礎，則可以多一些，達到190左右；身體差可以少一些，年齡加心率達到150左右即可。總之，步行運動要量力而行，否則會產生無氧代謝，導致不良影響或意外。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-cljvm0m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-cljvm0m","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"第三把鑰匙——多補維生素D，少吃豬肉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-j6w4yav","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-j6w4yav","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一項為期10年、涉及54.5萬美國人的研究發現，每天吃4盎司（約113克）左右牛肉或豬肉的人，早亡危險比更少吃肉的人高30%。雖然早期研究表明，大量吃紅肉會導致心臟病和結腸癌，但是這項研究首次以大規模的調查揭示了多肉飲食對壽命的影響。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-pkcb09f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-pkcb09f","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“這是因為，紅肉裏含有較多的雌激素，會增加女性患乳腺癌的風險；而且紅肉消化後產生的食物殘渣較少，使腸蠕動減弱，進而使有害物質在腸道內停留時間更長，增加直腸癌的風險。”"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-cevl0sv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-cevl0sv","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中國農業大學食品學院副教授范志紅表示，目前，在幾大類食物中，紅肉的攝入是最容易過量的，而一旦過量，它對人體的危害又是巨大的。健康的年輕人、活動量比較大的可適當增加紅肉的攝入，但老年人、消化能力差的人則要相應減少，心臟病、高血壓等高危人群，更要減少紅肉攝入，可用魚肉、雞肉等白肉代替。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-vwmaz1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-vwmaz1c","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"另有資料顯示，全球約有10億人缺乏維生素D。維生素D水準過低會導致骨質疏鬆症、糖尿病、高血壓和癌症。一項新研究發現，“陽光維生素”攝取不足的成年人早亡危險增加26%。美國愛因斯坦醫學院副教授邁克爾·梅拉米德博士表示，除了喝強化牛奶和適當補充維生素D之外，還應該每週曬曬太陽，每次10—15分鐘，最佳時間為上午11點至下午3點，可以達到補充維生素D的理想效果。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這裡出現錯誤，應該多吃黑芝麻或是海帶來補充鈣，絕對不可以喝牛奶的 ，讀者可知牛可以活幾歲嗎？)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-i1584l5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-i1584l5","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"第四把鑰匙——夫妻多牽手"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-hrmscwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-hrmscwu","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“在街上，經常能見到一個現象，‘海歸’夫婦或是外國夫婦散步時會手牽手，而在國內呢，大多數夫妻散步時都相距半米到一米，男的在前邊走，女的在後邊跟著。”洪昭光提倡，夫妻應該多牽手走路。因為人有一種“皮膚饑渴”，皮膚的接觸能產生明顯的心理和生理效應，通過生物電傳導，讓夫妻雙方體內都釋放內啡肽。內啡肽一多，免疫力就提高。美國密歇根州密歇根大學一項超過七年的研究發現，儘管都有壓力，但男人和女人如果能用大部分時間去關愛配偶，他們自身死亡的危險性就能減少36%。 科學家推測，關愛可以讓人釋放“結合”催產激素，去對抗能升高血壓和干擾免疫系統規律的一種壓力激素——皮質醇。密歇根大學的研究人員也發現，儘管有壓力，但是在7年時間內，將大部分時間用於照顧配偶的人，死亡風險降低36%。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-29foco3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-29foco3","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"第五把鑰匙——人緣好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-o9f3tnl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-o9f3tnl","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大量調查資料發現，百歲老人都具有好人緣的共同特點。社交生活越少，大腦裏會有越多焦慮引起的化學物質，就越可能生病。一項針對276個18到55歲的成人研究表明，有6個以上朋友的人比更少朋友的人抗擊感冒的能力強4倍。(這點我無法擁有，因為我不能有朋友，讀者知道為什麼嗎？我只能時常獨自一人開車去瘋狂一下。)"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-7oylg7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-7oylg7r","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“良好的人際關係是應對緊張的緩衝器，有益於心臟健康。”幾位諾貝爾醫學獎得主均指出，長期精神緊張會削弱免疫系統並加速細胞老化，最終讓人的壽命縮短4—8年。而人緣好的人，心情一般會很好，體內大量分泌有益的激素、酶類和乙醯膽鹼等，這些物質能把身體調節到最佳狀態，有利於健康長壽。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-7qj79hd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-7qj79hd","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-4n491vu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-4n491vu","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    愛吃西藥與維他命的台灣人請注意，直到目前為止，從未出現一篇報導說，長期吃西藥與維他命的人會長壽，所有有關長壽的報導幾乎千篇一律的都是出現在快樂人的身上，而西醫學是最讓人痛苦的醫學，從建立病名開始，到吃藥、開刀、化療、放射線療等，無一不讓人感到恐懼與痛苦，所以越接近西醫的人，自然就越短命。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155319-76oihst","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155319-76oihst","updated":"20240521155319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年01月13日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155324-krssiso","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155324-krssiso"}},{"ID":"20240521155332-oy2pb8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155332-oy2pb8h","updated":"20240521155332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"金氏紀錄：世界最長壽人瑞 知念婆婆去世"}]},{"ID":"20240521155332-p7xv92o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155332-p7xv92o","updated":"20240521155332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/05/04 18:36 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"黃啟霖"}]},{"ID":"20240521155332-00em9pd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155332-00em9pd","updated":"20240521155332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"金氏世界紀錄4日表示，金氏紀錄中世界最長壽的人瑞、日本老婦人知念鎌(Kama Chinen)，已經在5月2日去世，享年114歲又357天，距離她115歲生日，只差了大約一個星期。金氏紀錄表達了哀思。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155332-qb0vc19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155332-qb0vc19","updated":"20240521155332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"金氏紀錄指出，住在琉球(沖繩)的知念老婆婆，出生於1895年5月10日，一生橫跨3個世紀，儘管晚年只能坐在輪椅上，但也總是樂天知命，享受自然的美妙，並且喜歡外出。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(島上風景好，空氣好，水質好，這才是真正長壽的原因所在。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155332-zuusrbv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155332-zuusrbv","updated":"20240521155332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在知念老婆婆去世之後，全世界最長壽人瑞的頭銜，改落到法國老婦人尤金．布蘭查德(Eugenie Blanchard)，她今年也是114歲，目前住在加勒比海群島中的瓜德羅普島(Guadeloupe)，她出生於1896年2月16日。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(這位長壽的法國女人跟上面那位日本女人一樣，都是住在偏僻的島上生活一輩子。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155332-8iff3jq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155332-8iff3jq","updated":"20240521155332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155332-9g0lq07","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155332-9g0lq07","updated":"20240521155332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    許多證據顯示出來，第一 : 女的比男的長壽許多，我想跟心理有關，男的比較愛好爭名奪利，女的比較淡泊名利，第二 : 居住地點都在遠離大城市的偏遠地區，因為住在那裡，醫療條件很差，西藥取得不易，或是當地貧困，人們無法負擔超貴的西藥，所以這些人都沒有被西藥廠汙染，因此遠離西藥就是第二個長壽的原因，第三 : 住在偏遠地方或是島上，因為當地最接近自然，風景必然壯麗，每天看著這種絕世美景，不用看到讓妳生氣的丈夫，妳心情自然很好，這就是第三個長壽的原因。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155332-ld6sqfa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155332-ld6sqfa","updated":"20240521155332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年05月06日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155332-sm9b5e6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155332-sm9b5e6"}},{"ID":"20240521155339-7gv6a2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155339-7gv6a2f","updated":"20240521155339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"魯凱人瑞阿嬤 108歲經歷清末"}]},{"ID":"20240521155339-tr5za8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155339-tr5za8z","updated":"20240521155339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新日期:2010/08/08 12:01"}]},{"ID":"20240521155339-7glcpjr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155339-7glcpjr","updated":"20240521155339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清朝早已經滅亡了九十九年，在屏東卻還一位橫跨清朝和民國時代的老人瑞，今年已經108歲，而且耳聰目明，八月七號是這位魯凱族老阿嬤的生日，家族席開四桌，數代同堂，由於母兼父職，子孫也提前幫她過父親節。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155339-ma4luj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155339-ma4luj9","updated":"20240521155339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"穿著原住民魯凱族傳統服飾的老奶奶，手裡拿著細毛線，動作靈活的織了起來，注意看她可沒戴眼鏡喔，別以為不稀奇，人家四十多歲就老花了，阿嬤已經一百零八歲，什麼?太誇張，不相信?拿身分證給你瞧，彭玉梅民國前九年生，還是清末的時代，這一零八的蛋糕可是當之無愧。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155339-xd7vwu6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155339-xd7vwu6","updated":"20240521155339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很想知到她吃什麼對不對，女兒來告訴你，不煙不酒吃野菜，老阿嬤現在不僅可以運運動，作家事，生活都可以自己打理，唯一的遺憾是回不了霧台佳暮老家，剛剛有上字翻譯，阿嬤就是這個意思，幸好子孫滿堂，是讓他比較快樂的事，席開四桌，老伴走的早，母肩父職很辛苦，今天也是大家提前為她過父親節。(民視新聞洪明生屏東報導)"}]},{"ID":"20240521155339-n37xxoy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155339-n37xxoy","updated":"20240521155339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155339-369tp56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155339-369tp56","updated":"20240521155339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    這位婦女之所以能長壽，就是因為住在山上，空氣好水質好，吃的簡單，沒有西藥廠願意去偏遠山上，因為只有很少數人住在那裡，沒有錢可賺，連直銷公司都不願意去，所以她沒有被西藥與維他命污染，這就是她長壽的原因，而且她還耳聰目明，織布都不需要戴眼鏡，這已經是證據，證明今人不如古人，因為現代人都喜歡吃西藥與維他命，所以都變得短命，記憶又提前衰退，骨質也快速退化，耳目失聰，真是可憐被西藥廠欺騙的一群。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155339-dtawvpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155339-dtawvpm","updated":"20240521155339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年08月07日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155339-4w7tstq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155339-4w7tstq"}},{"ID":"20240521155345-olf3fir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155345-olf3fir","updated":"20240521155345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"102歲高祖母 千餘字三字經全背對"}]},{"ID":"20240521155345-tgx6syt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155345-tgx6syt","updated":"20240521155345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【聯合報╱記者曹馥年、王燕華／連線報導】"}]},{"ID":"20240521155345-sp2kngc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155345-sp2kngc","updated":"20240521155345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"家有一老，如有一寶！嘉義縣大林鎮一○二歲人瑞曾林美，與長子、孫子、曾孫、玄孫共十人五代同堂住在一起，曾林美身體硬朗，妙語如珠，是家裡的大寶貝，天天逗得全家笑聲不斷。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155345-97slzc0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155345-97slzc0","updated":"20240521155345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾林美記憶力驚人，兒孫最愛聽她背三字經，全文共一千五百九十六字，她一字不錯，常故意將結尾最後一句「戒之哉，宜勉力」改成「豆干菜，炒沒熟」；眾人大喊「哪有這句？」她妙答「這是你們教的」，大家笑翻。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155345-hhjl0g7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155345-hhjl0g7","updated":"20240521155345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她說，三字經是午睡時聽兒孫背書「睏ㄟ時學的」，孫子曾偼三在一旁笑說「阿嬤是『睡眠學習法』」；五十多年前的餅店廣告詞她也記得一清二楚，常當兒歌唱給九歲玄孫聽。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155345-1re4mgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155345-1re4mgs","updated":"20240521155345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾林美出生於雲林縣口湖鄉，婚後與丈夫搬到大林，夫妻白手起家，近百名子孫感情緊密，家族常聚會，她總得意地看著滿堂兒孫說：「這血脈都是我傳的！」"}]},{"ID":"20240521155345-x84y2pp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155345-x84y2pp","updated":"20240521155345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"她八十八歲時出車禍重傷，在加護病房住數月才復原，「在陰間人緣不好，被趕回來」，住院前晚上得吃宵夜才睡得著，車禍後滿口牙被撞斷只剩一顆，習慣依然不變。身體不舒服時愛吃麻油麵線配米酒，腳水腫吃糖蜜水煮南瓜消腫，「不夠甜不吃」，她最愛肉粽，「蒸軟一點，沒牙還是能吞」。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(不吃西藥的人。)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155345-mnjyiam","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155345-mnjyiam","updated":"20240521155345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五代同堂，曾家屋簷下從沒有吵架聲，曾林美以自創七言勸世歌取代責罵，「做人父母要平正，不通疼小怨大子」，是她的持家方針。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155345-7mm2rcl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155345-7mm2rcl","updated":"20240521155345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"現代年輕夫妻嚮往小家庭，在雲林六輕擔任工程人員的卅三歲曾孫曾國倫，婚後沒想過搬家，「大家庭能互相照顧」，夫妻忙於工作，長輩顧孩子，讓他們沒有後顧之憂。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155345-kbz07o0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155345-kbz07o0","updated":"20240521155345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾偼三說，今年祖父母節時間倉促，外地子孫來不及回家團圓，昨天紛紛打電話祝福阿太。曾林美樂呵呵說：「下次擱慶祝嘸要緊，今年尬一厝人作伙呷晚飯，也是足歡喜」。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155345-s4zakya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155345-s4zakya","updated":"20240521155345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"家住宜蘭縣蘇澳鎮一○二歲人瑞陳許阿蔥，也是五代同堂，昨天由女兒、媳婦、孫女陪著過祖父母節，先到素食餐廳用餐，再逛百貨公司、喝咖啡。她開心地笑說：「很歡喜。」"}]},{"ID":"20240521155345-wmn24q3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155345-wmn24q3","updated":"20240521155345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"評論"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240521155345-4o1p6xi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155345-4o1p6xi","updated":"20240521155345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    凡是不吃西藥的人都會長壽，而且記憶超好，絕對沒有老人癡呆症與骨質疏鬆症。"}]},{"ID":"20240521155345-7p2hm5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155345-7p2hm5v","updated":"20240521155345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2010年08月29日"}]},{"ID":"20240521155346-hovx7ju","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240521155346-hovx7ju"}},{"ID":"20240521155349-k8s0mov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240521155349-k8s0mov"}}]}